inl note_of_bend_backend_5 () = Note ("BEND-BACKEND", 5u32, "2026-10-15T12:13Z", "main-thread", "08:13 pack 2 reviewed (single-flight-20261015-073154): Bend list 344 -> 364 rows, the 20 new rows (8/16-bit ints, mega runtime_native roots) agree with C; every existing Bend row changed residual only (6-line narrowing prelude), behaviour identical. Install + bless queued. Follow-up: emit the narrowing helpers only when used.")
