inl note_of_zed_test_runnables_10 () = Note ("ZED-TEST-RUNNABLES", 10u32, "2026-10-19T17:12Z", "helper-lane-2", "2026-10-19 13:13 lap 9 grain: the sibling-layout path of the language tasks.json checked from a non-spiral worktree: with ZED_WORKTREE_ROOT=C:\\home\\git\\dice the script path dice/../spiral/apps/zed/tasks/test-at-row.ps1 exists, and -DryRun on dice/lib/dice.spi row 3 resolves the enclosing block (run_notebook --test dice_dice). So the language tasks work in sibling repos without a per-repo .zed. Next: user's Zed check (gutter button + keybinding), then the user drops spiral/.zed/tasks.json")
