inl note_of_samples_to_test_blocks_4 () = Note ("SAMPLES-TO-TEST-BLOCKS", 4u32, "2026-10-19T12:20Z", "main-thread", "2026-10-19 08:20 lap 1 grain: the first family slice (ebpf_arith, ebpf_shift, ebpf_bool as 3 test blocks, c + zig, failwith on a wrong exit) moved from job tmp/night/ebpf-blocks into spiral/lab/SAMPLES-TO-TEST-BLOCKS with packageDir ../../apps/compiler/tmp/samples (the job-tmp copy failed Package not loaded; the in-tree run had passed) Next: HEAVY QUEUE: Cells gate of the lab copy; then the remaining 28 ebpf_* samples as blocks and a suite-time before/after")
