inl note_of_lean_backend_29 () = Note ("LEAN-BACKEND", 29u32, "2026-11-01T04:50Z", "main", "main 00:5x LAB CODE IS SAFE (user 11-01 00:2x: 'check for all lab references in history... make sure we didn't lose that code... to repurpose them or groom their tasks'). This item's lab/LEAN-BACKEND folder (1 files: lean-stable.py) is archived in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\archive\\20261030-232045 (blob-verified). Restore it into its proper repo place with: pwsh C:\\home\\git\\i574n.github\\scripts\\scratch-archive.ps1 -Restore '%LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\archive\\20261030-232045\\manifest.tsv' -RestoreTo <repo dir> -Only 'LEAN-BACKEND/*'. Next step for the owner at its next pull: restore the useful files in place as incomplete drafts (Cells heals them in place), or record why it starts over.")
