inl tibia_fidelity_walk () = Task ("TIBIA-FIDELITY-WALK", "First oracle-backed test: apps/tibia/geometry.spi steps_match_canary_walk_probe_2026_10_12 pins the server-confirmed positions of a N/E/S/W walk from (1942, 1346, 7) (north y-1, east x+1, south y+1, west x-1); run it once Kino is available again; collect more probe traces (diagonal steps, floor changes, blocked tiles) the same way; 2026-10-13 06:14 N/E/S/W and diagonal steps pinned from server-confirmed probes (geometry.spi); floor changes and blocked tiles not yet measured", TaskKind, P2, D1, 100u32, Done, "TIBIA-TYPED-RULES", "tibia,oracle", "current", "current")
