inl tibia_game_handshake () = Task ("TIBIA-GAME-HANDSHAKE", "First game-port message for the Spiral headless client, from Canary 3.6.1 protocolgame.cpp:814-900: u16 operating system, u16 protocol version (1511), u32 client version, string client version, string asset hash (version >= 1334), u8 preview state, then an RSA block with the XTEA key (4 x u32), u8 game-master flag, string session key (email + \"\\n\" + password, split unless authType is \"session\"), string character name; checksum method is sequence numbers when the declared OS is an OTClient one (<= CLIENTOS_OTCLIENT_MAC) and Adler-32 otherwise (old protocol always Adler-32); apps/tibia/wire.spi (2026-10-12) already has XTEA encrypt/decrypt (published vector 497df3d072612cb5) and Adler-32 (Wikipedia = 0x11E60398) in u32 arithmetic, and the same XTEA loop reproduces the published vector on WGSL (spiral-wgsl) and C, Adler-32 steps too (probe 2026-10-12); missing: byte buffers (needs arrays), RSA raw exponentiation with key.pem (bignum), TCP", TaskKind, P4, D4, 0u32, Paused, "TIBIA-HEADLESS-CLIENT", "tibia,protocol,spiral,team:tibia", "current", "current")
