inl tibia_gpu_rules_tests () = Task ("TIBIA-GPU-RULES-TESTS", "Rules modules carry ///> wgsl status tests next to their ///> rust + ///> c tests (2026-10-12: rng mix32 reference values, damage max melee formula, coins fewest-coins breakdown, wire XTEA vector all pass on spiral-wgsl through Kino; broken expectations fail); extend to every module once runtime unions land on WGSL (vitality typestate, spell groups, direction), then pin hunt_sim golden_seed_7 on the GPU (TIBIA-HUNT-SIM-WGSL); 18:10 tibia lane: ///> wgsl status tests pass in 7 of 10 apps/tibia modules (geometry, cooldowns, creatures, rng, damage, coins, wire); vitality, hunt and hunt_sim wait for runtime unions on WGSL (WGSL-NULLARY-UNIONS, then payload unions); apps/tibia 66 tests all passing; adding the 3 GPU tests re-ran only those (memo_hits 20 of 23, 21 s); correction: the note above is from 17:56, not 18:10; 2026-10-13 06:14 every apps/tibia module (12) carries a ///> wgsl test, including vitality (GADT in a union payload), policy, combat (2000-swing statistics bit-identical to Rust/C) and hunt_sim's golden seed", TaskKind, P2, D2, 100u32, Done, "WGSL-NULLARY-UNIONS,WGSL-PAYLOAD-UNIONS", "tibia,wgsl,tests", "current", "current")
