inl tibia_sim_deaths_metric () = Task ("TIBIA-SIM-DEATHS-METRIC", "The simulator reports deaths and time-to-death per seed, and the policy tests compare kills subject to deaths (the arena metric in apps/tibia/BENCHMARK.md): the heal-threshold sweep currently ranks by kills alone, which rewards healing late (20 -> 114 kills vs 120 -> 105) without pricing the risk of dying; 2026-10-13 06:14 policy_score = kills - 50 * deaths and total_deaths_against are in hunt_sim; the cyclops tests compare deaths", TaskKind, P2, D2, 100u32, Done, "TIBIA-SIM-POLICIES", "tibia,arena", "current", "current")
