inl note_of_kit_jobs_57 () = Note ("KIT-JOBS", 57u32, "2026-11-06T22:37Z", "kit-fc1568a6", "11-06 18:3x kit: the remaining slice from tibia n-last is BUILT (unstaged): kit_jobs_doctor_model gains finding UnwatchedJob (pid, job): a LIVE supervised job with no kit job wait process holding it (waited_jobs collects JobWaiter ids; a remote.ps1 wait runs kit job wait <id> on the job machine, so it counts there). Line: unwatched-job pid=.. job=.. (live, but no kit job wait holds it; nothing will notice when it ends). Test: a live supervisor with no waiter is the finding; the draining-host case now carries its waiter so it stays about draining. Node probe job-1794004492358-kit-probe1106y (model notebook plus kit_jobs_doctor, _env, _servers sizes; doctor.rs was 907). Rides the train after TRAIN36.")
