inl kit_idiomatic_core () = Task ("KIT-IDIOMATIC-CORE", "rewrite eoie's core as idiomatic Spiral the way apps/tibia is going: a GADT command algebra (operation indexed by its receipt type), existential handlers, HKT-style receipt/result views, no rust_global or !!!! macro blobs; Rust stays the compiled target (rayon for parallel walk/search); keep the 1000-line crate gate, which is paying off; foundation for the one-call verbs; source: transcript sweep 2026-10-13 22:13 over ~45k tool calls (claude 41.6k, codex 2.0k, opencode 1.1k, grok 0.2k; zed 8 threads parsed, tool shape not yet recognized); report in main's job tmp/sweep/intent-report.txt; 2026-10-14 03:56 lane 3 typed design of eoie do (not compiled; %USERPROFILE%\\.claude\\jobs\\5a6e53fb\\tmp\\eoie-do\\model.spi, 939 lines, no macros, plus cases.md): GADT statement effect receipt error with 29 constructors (Edit/Write/Copy staged_write; Show/Around/Excerpt/Search/Files/Dirs/GroupLines/Nearest/Json/Table/Diff/Hash/Env/Exists/Errors/Processes/GitHistory/GitStatus/GitLog pure_read; Run/Stop/Wait/JobStart/JobWait/GitInit/GitCommit external_effect), one receipt record and one error union per statement kind, existential handles (exists kind. handle kind * handle_target kind for process/job/output), receipt views as prototypes (receipt_tallies, receipt_lines, error_lines, error_exit), effect_policy prototype for rayon fan-out (per file/dir/repo inside a statement, across consecutive pure/staged statements between barriers, never across external effects); reuse: text-replace expectations, exact_replace and batch-write commit engine with rollback, parallel_search walk/sort, fs-read/slice/context/list, fs-copy, hash, process/observation, batch-plan step algebra, rooted paths; replaced: patch/fs-actions/fs-batch-write/batch-plan file-then-call entry points and the patch plan grammar, macro blobs move behind one Rust-boundary module per capability", Story, P0, D8, 0u32, Planned, "KIT-STYLE-CHECKPOINT", "kit,one-call,adoption,team:rig", "current", "current")
inl planning_of_kit_idiomatic_core () = Planning ("KIT-IDIOMATIC-CORE", Minutes 660u32, Load Light, Assigned Agent)
