inl note_of_kit_idiomatic_core_12 () = Note ("KIT-IDIOMATIC-CORE", 12u32, "2026-11-09T16:24Z", "rig-fc1568a6", "11-09 15:2x rig groom (the gate's split request; replaces the provisional 1800 m). Checked first: the two design drafts named in the description are GONE with the 10-28 wipe (the 939-line eoie-do statement GADT model.spi and cases.md under the old job tmp); the job-admission slice landed as rig_window_admission. So the algebra is re-derived from rig do's current grammar, not revived. MILESTONES: re-measure the baseline with the installed census (rust_global, host blocks, concat5, Rc wraps, typed command unions per package) 60 m; statement effect GADT for the pure_read family in a model crate, indexed by receipt type 120 m; the staged_write family with its receipts 120 m; the external_effect family with existential process and job handles 120 m; one rig do verb family moved onto the algebra end to end 120 m; retire the largest rust_global cluster onto typed receipts 120 m")
