inl note_of_kit_spiral_tests_1 () = Note ("KIT-SPIRAL-TESTS", 1u32, "2026-10-14T10:44Z", "user", "2026-10-14 06:44 user: no eoie restart now, the Tibia style (GADTs/existentials/HKTs, no 1k-loc crate gate) has not proven itself yet; balance: no new hand-written .rs tests from today (rule), and an existing tests/*.rs is converted to Spiral test blocks only when a change touches its package, not as a big-bang; priority P0 -> P2")
