inl note_of_x_client_1 () = Note ("X-CLIENT", 1u32, "2026-10-16T01:12Z", "user", "2026-10-15 21:20: Edge is signed in as @fc1943s, which has no X developer account (console.x.com/onboarding asks to accept the PPU pilot developer agreement and policy, then credits need a payment card). Agent did not accept terms or touch payment. Remaining: user onboards, adds credits, creates app, sets X_BEARER_TOKEN; then one capped live run (timeline --limit 5 fc1943s) confirms post.fields against the live API.")
