inl note_of_x_near_provenance_5 () = Note ("X-NEAR-PROVENANCE", 5u32, "2026-11-01T06:37Z", "x", "2026-11-01 02:37 x: REVERTED my 10-31 19:03 groom move (Planned -> Paused again). I read only the last note and missed the user's deferral: X-ON-NEAR's title and n4 (10-20) record 'deferred, user 2026-10-18: too much for now', with the resume condition 'back to Planned when the user starts NEAR work'. This item is part of X-ON-NEAR (its child, fold-in or federation half), so it shares that reason and resume. The user's 11-01 00:2x remark that Cells will LATER live in NEAR contracts with zkVM receipts is direction, not a start. Lesson recorded: groom re-decisions read ALL notes and the title, not only the last note.")
