inl note_of_convo_in_spiral_35 () = Note ("CONVO-IN-SPIRAL", 35u32, "2026-11-09T15:03Z", "rig-fc1568a6", "11-09 11:5x rig groom, CHECKED the 10-28 next step: lib json.spi, json_scan.spi, json_real.spir and json_schema.spi shipped in spiral lib; the record/replay first slice (lab/CONVO-IN-SPIRAL/replay.spi, 10-19) is LOST with the lab folder in the 10-28 profile wipe (absent from kit, spiral, eoie and the drafts store). MILESTONES: rebuild the record/replay store over a typed transcript (Call pushes, Result pops the innermost, replay looks a result up) as a kit model with tests 90 m; persist exchanges as JSON lines through the lib json codec 60 m; tool schemas: unions as oneOf/enum and optional fields in json_schema 120 m; a type-directed JSON decoder into the same record 120 m; the .convo surface syntax reader 120 m.")
