inl note_of_kit_memory_adapters_12 () = Note ("KIT-MEMORY-ADAPTERS", 12u32, "2026-11-01T14:46Z", "kit", "11-01 10:4x kit: candidate adapter target: akitaonrails/ai-memory (markdown wiki + SQLite FTS5, cross-provider handover). An import adapter would read its wiki pages as untrusted data into typed memory records with provenance ai-memory:<page>; see KIT-DEFINITION.")
