inl note_of_cells_new_project_31 () = Note ("CELLS-NEW-PROJECT", 31u32, "2026-11-06T12:46Z", "main", "main 11-06 10:5x DoD backfill (kit lint): DoD: mix spiral.new scaffolds a project that passes its own gate on the first run, with no .ps1 templates (a Spiral scaffold command). Next step: PS1-TO-SPIRAL's port of the template step.")
inl note_of_cells_new_project_32 () = Note ("CELLS-NEW-PROJECT", 32u32, "2026-11-11T04:40Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 11-11 ABSORBED by RIG-NEW-SCAFFOLD (user 11-11: the template moves into rig and must be state of the art); its DoD, a new project passing its own gate on the first run, is part of that item. Resume when: never as a separate item; closes when RIG-NEW-SCAFFOLD is Done.")
inl cells_exhaustive_tests () = Task ("CELLS-EXHAUSTIVE-TESTS", "Bounded-domain exhaustive and property test blocks: compare two implementations over a declared domain (for example an integer reimplementation against a floating-point oracle over all inputs up to N), report the first counterexamples, run on the oracle backend only.", Feature, P1, D3, 100u32, Done, "", "cells,testing,properties", "current", "current")
