inl note_of_codespaces_button_all_repos_9 () = Note ("CODESPACES-BUTTON-ALL-REPOS", 9u32, "2026-10-31T15:00Z", "main", "10-31 11:00 main: the rest of n2's census CHECKED: blog, dir-tree-html and i574n.github.io already carry .devcontainer/devcontainer.json and the README badge, and each badge's repo= id matches GitHub (gh api: blog 1422846800, dir-tree-html 1411208249, i574n.github.io 637595591; all public, default branch main). Every i574n repo now has the button except azeroth (the user's call, n3). NOT proven anywhere: a codespace actually booting needs the user's GitHub session after the pushes (fiscal's and kit's are unstaged). Progress 55 -> 90; Done once a codespace boots per repo.")
