inl note_of_edition3_280_split_5 () = Note ("EDITION3-280-SPLIT", 5u32, "2026-11-06T12:30Z", "main", "main 11-06 09:5x DoD backfill (kit lint): DoD: every top-level block in every repo's Spiral sources is within 280 X weight (mix spiral.cell_budget census = 0 over), each split gate-proven. Next step: run the cell_budget census per repo and split it into one child item per repo.")
