inl note_of_x_done_76 () = Note ("X-DONE", 76u32, "2026-10-24T07:38Z", "x", "10-24 03:38 x: post-block verify of the x landing = %TEMP%\\x-world\\lib-draft\\verify_x_landing.ps1, ONE heavy job after normalize decide4, replacing run8 (the pre-commit covers its notebooks). Generated from apps/client/build.ps1 lines 1-38 with PSScriptRoot pinned, so it follows x's own build: regenerate every crate (BuildSpiral + rust-modules), gate.ps1 -Enforce, x-compat probe + findings, cargo build --release. Then e2e.ps1 -Accept writes the new tutorial answers into README (hana timeline, the 141-CJK refusal, the 2 resume steps, cost lines; land_all's step 3), then the full scripts/build.ps1 pre-commit. x's own build.ps1 is untouched. chain21d and paging cw2 wait for it, so the pre-commit gets the box to itself. The landers' guard refuses lib writes while its notebooks read lib.")
