inl fiscal_xsd_patterns_large () = Task ("FISCAL-XSD-PATTERNS-LARGE", "SEFAZ DFA follow-up: (1) one direct-coded state function per distinct pattern per module (scratchpad generator.shared.spi, staged; today each type has its own copy and modules grew 30-110%); (2) the 7 patterns over 128 states (NF-e QR-code URLs with .* prefixes, up to 494 states) get a table-driven or split DFA instead of the derivative matcher; gate: family gate 17/17 + 13 examples 0 messages + module sizes and the Cells VM memory peak per module", Story, P1, D4, 50u32, Planned, "FISCAL-EDITION3-ROUND,FISCAL-VERSIONED-FAMILIES", "sefaz,xsd,regex,dfa,team:fiscal,fiscal", "current", "current")
