inl kit_heal_edit_hook () = Task ("KIT-HEAL-EDIT-HOOK", "Edit-time drift check: a PostToolUse hook on Edit/Write of eoie .spi/.spiproj runs eoie standards on the change and blocks with the lib function to use (sm'/am'/listm'/...) when the added lines carry a host macro outside the boundary package, a $'{ let block, Rc::<str>::from, a rust_std_string call, or a spiproj without spiral-", Story, P1, D2, 100u32, Done, "RUST-INLINE-SINGLE-USE,KIT-MEMORY-ADAPTERS", "kit,heal,hook", "current", "current")
