inl note_of_kit_window_held_marker_1 () = Note ("KIT-WINDOW-HELD-MARKER", 1u32, "2026-10-22T05:52Z", "eoie", "01:52 requested by main (CELLS-GATE-MACHINE-WINDOW): spiral apps/cells/spi/lib_gate.ps1 takes its own test-suite window sized by expected_minutes.ps1; with the marker it skips the request when an outer window run compile already holds one (same pattern as the scaffold's -InsideHeavySlot, which EOIE_HEAVY_HELD would retire). Planned for release E.")
