inl note_of_kit_pages_verify_10 () = Note ("KIT-PAGES-VERIFY", 10u32, "2026-11-09T14:07Z", "microblog-b7595ac3", "11-09 10:1x microblog groom: the self-verifying deploy IS written. rig .github/workflows/gh-pages.yml writes gh-pages/_deploy.txt = GITHUB_SHA, then a 'verify the deploy is live' step polls <owner>.github.io/<repo>/_deploy.txt for up to 6 min and checks the index has the readme and viewport marks, the same shape as dice and spiral. It has NOT been observed green: the last 4 push runs (11-06..11-09) fail earlier in the build job (contract test typed_handoff_is_readable_and_versionless, filed as RIG-CI-STATUS-CONTRACT), so the deploy and verify job never runs. dod: one green push run where the verify step passes. next: after RIG-CI-STATUS-CONTRACT is green, read that run's verify step.")
