inl note_of_kit_cache_inventory_4 () = Note ("KIT-CACHE-INVENTORY", 4u32, "2026-11-07T14:14Z", "main", "INLINE TEXT of the old agile_eoie dump entries (user 11-07: keep the lessons inline so the dump file link can be lost). Source: eoie-consolidated agile_eoie.md (2026-10-22, status measured at eoie a831bad), copies at %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\drafts\\kit\\KIT-EOIE-DUMP-GROOM\\ and i574n.github\\recovered\\agile-eoie\\from-des073\\eoie-consolidated\\; verdicts from KIT-EOIE-DUMP-GROOM n3. Verdict Covered by this item. CARGO-6 · Disk and cache discipline · P2 · ota, ge2e · Open / Inspect `.cargo/config.toml`, check free space and target-disk health before building, refuse an accidental cold target override, inventory caches with retention and a gated prune that preserves the active target, check cached test executables still carry their execute bit, offer a lean profile under pressure (incremental off, debug 0), and keep an emergency reserve so EOIE can still write receipts when the disk fills.")
