inl note_of_kit_run_twice_4 () = Note ("KIT-RUN-TWICE", 4u32, "2026-11-07T14:15Z", "main", "INLINE TEXT of the old agile_eoie dump entries (user 11-07: keep the lessons inline so the dump file link can be lost). Source: eoie-consolidated agile_eoie.md (2026-10-22, status measured at eoie a831bad), copies at %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\drafts\\kit\\KIT-EOIE-DUMP-GROOM\\ and i574n.github\\recovered\\agile-eoie\\from-des073\\eoie-consolidated\\; verdicts from KIT-EOIE-DUMP-GROOM n3. Verdict Covered by this item. FIXT-7 · Run-twice idempotency probe · P2 · ota · Open / Materialize a small fixture root and index from a list of real input files (preserving relative paths, skipping and reporting non-UTF-8 names), run a transforming tool on it twice, capture both runs' stdout/stderr and JSON output as receipts, assert that the second run changes nothing, and localize any residue to the smallest diff with the rule or step that produced it. Requested in nine oracle-to-ansi bundles as `patch-all-probe --twice`; generalized to any tool that rewrites files.")
