inl note_of_kit_gap_intake_5 () = Note ("KIT-GAP-INTAKE", 5u32, "2026-10-31T23:48Z", "kit", "10-31 19:5x kit, pause re-decision (main pre-night groom; R3 is now \"never auto-pause for silence\"): Paused -> PLANNED. It was paused by the 10-28 silence groom (\"nothing queued\"), not by a blocker, and no note names an external condition. Back in agile next at its priority; its first step stays the one in the 10-28 note: check whether the remaining milestone shipped in a later train (installed kit 4983F9C0, TRAIN6) and close it with that evidence, else do the next milestone.")
