inl note_of_kit_no_claude_names_1 () = Note ("KIT-NO-CLAUDE-NAMES", 1u32, "2026-10-24T11:17Z", "eoie", "07:2x groom: rides KIT-RENAME's census (step 1 lists every 'claude' token with its consumer: hooks, the jobs-home owner detection that looks for claude.exe as owner, and docs). Rule: a name becomes a generic role ('agent session', owner = nearest non-shell ancestor) unless a test proves behavior depends on it; consumers in other sessions are told before the change lands.")
