inl note_of_kit_agile_requested_1 () = Note ("KIT-AGILE-REQUESTED", 1u32, "2026-10-24T13:04Z", "eoie", "Rule written before measuring: requested is a typed record (who: user|team word; at: UTC stamp; quote: note number), set with agile add/edit --requested and shown by agile show and list --json. The time-criticality term adds the item's own priority weight times min(days since requested, 7) / 7, so a week-old user request counts double and never more. An item with no requested record scores exactly as today. Migration: titles containing '(user YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM' get the field filled by a preview/apply verb in the migrate-tags shape. The title text stays.")
