inl note_of_kit_agile_requested_3 () = Note ("KIT-AGILE-REQUESTED", 3u32, "2026-11-09T11:54Z", "rig-fc1568a6", "11-09 08:4x local rig, first slice as a pure model (unprobed; post-train probe batch), SIDE FILE design like KIT-AGILE-CADENCE-FIELD (state/requests.spi rows, no new Task field, no near-gate state crate touched): src/rig_agile_requests/requests.spi (HostFree + LibReferenced, kit standards 0): requester union (ByUser | ByTeam word), request record (item, by, day, note), civil_days (days from civil, no host date code), age_days, urgency_bonus weight requested today = weight * min(days, 7) / 7 exactly as the 10-24 rule (a week-old request doubles, never more; an unreadable day adds 0), request_from_title for the migration from (user YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM stamps in titles. 2 test blocks. Dep KIT-AGILE-P0-WEIGHT gives the weight. Next: agile next adds urgency_bonus for items with a request row; agile edit --requested <who>; a migrate preview/apply. TypeFeatures: requester union, request record.")
