inl cells_edition3_keywords () = Task ("CELLS-EDITION3-KEYWORDS", "Cells classifies top-level blocks by edition-2 keyword prefix, so an edition-3 file's :! / := / :~ / :== / :| / :< / :? / :+ / :& lines are lowered into main's body and the test cell fails to parse (found by tibia 10-24 20:5x, lab/E3-NOMINAL-PROBE). Sites: apps/cells/spi cell.spi declaration/binding_keyword/main_line, text.spi is_value_binding, document.spi only_opens_from, notebook.spi opens; lib/spiral/cells/memo.ex block_shape (definition names in the memo key) and cells.ex own_main", Story, P0, D2, 100u32, Done, "", "cells,edition3,parsing,main", "current", "current")
