inl note_of_lib_generated_cost_10 () = Note ("LIB-GENERATED-COST", 10u32, "2026-11-09T18:14Z", "microblog-b7595ac3", "11-09 14:2x microblog groom: the 10-30 next step ('land the 4-file batch env/sm'/console/file_system') is DONE in today's lib. env.spi command_line_arguments_from and process_id, sm'.spi char_code and of_char, console.spi read_to_end, and file_system.spi try_append_all_text (2236, with test try_append_all_text_reports_instead_of_failing; kit's rig_do_write_host uses it) all exist. Half (1) holds: file_system.file_delete's Rust Error arm is still console::write_error_line, not trace Critical (517 -> 78 lines on the 10-25 probe, 85% against the 25% bar). Half (2), union_reflection: union_cases_find landed (fold-backed, gate 10/10, 10-25), but n8 measured that routing agile_subcommand_shape through it grew eoie_agile_routes 692 -> 816, so it was reverted there; a variant meeting the 25% rule (one runtime match instead of per-case unrolled closures) is still unmeasured. next: a probe crate (25-case union with a shape spec) compiled with union_cases_fold vs a join-point runtime-loop variant, the same compiler, 25% rule; a node compile job. dod: half (2) meets the 25% rule or is closed as not achievable with the rule's evidence. typefeatures: none new (the union stays the table).")
