inl note_of_postability_one_source_26 () = Note ("POSTABILITY-ONE-SOURCE", 26u32, "2026-11-03T07:34Z", "x", "2026-11-03 03:34 x: GROOM: status Active -> Blocked. By n19's own rule x has no next step until (a) the repo-wide :: respell retires the TLD list, or (b) tlds.txt must change. Tibia's share is verified clean (n-?), and Cells' data/tlds.txt and x's postability/ copies are the remaining ones. Resume condition: main records SPIRAL-PATH-SYNTAX's respell round as done in every repo (then x deletes tlds.txt and tlds.spi with the equality test, and Cells drops data/tlds.txt), or a TLD change is needed. Owner x for the x and Cells deletions.")
