inl note_of_profile_restore_drill_port_7 () = Note ("PROFILE-RESTORE-DRILL-PORT", 7u32, "2026-11-09T18:40Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 11-09 18:4x CLOSED AS SUPERSEDED: the .py this item ports (profile-restore-drill-node.py) no longer exists; i574n.github/scripts now holds profile-restore-drill-node.ps1 (node side) + profile-restore-drill.ps1 (box side), registered as the scheduled task profile-restore-drill (next run 11-10 05:40), so the .py drift that filed it is gone. The remaining spiral-first step (a kit verb instead of the two .ps1) belongs with the mirror/backup scripts and is now listed under KIT-FOLD-MIRROR-BACKUP (team:rig). Proof: scripts listing 11-09 18:4x + schtasks query.")
