inl note_of_regex_antimirov_1 () = Note ("REGEX-ANTIMIROV", 1u32, "2026-11-01T20:25Z", "regex", "regex 16:4x. DOD (n5 D2c, D3c): partial derivatives as a deduplicated term set, linear forms over char classes, NFA simulation by sets of terms; per pattern the reachable partial-derivative set size is <= alphabetic width + 1 (test over the curated corpus, the bound printed); agrees with the Brzozowski matcher on the seeded corpus; a forged support assignment is rejected (legacy negative_antimirov_* as blueprint). NEXT STEP: partial/ notebook after REGEX-SYNTAX lands. TYPEFEATURESET PLAN: positions as a nominal (symbol_position) so the bound counts typed slots, not ints; the bound outcome Within (size, width) | Over (size, width); terms reuse the syntax re union (no second AST). FIELDS: estimate 360, load light, assignee agent.")
