inl note_of_regex_spiral_deletion_5 () = Note ("REGEX-SPIRAL-DELETION", 5u32, "2026-11-10T11:22Z", "org3", "org3 ROLE-REPLACEMENT + DELETION-PRECONDITION (KERNEL-AS-COMPILER-CORPUS org3 part \"apply compiler's rule to regex+zeta\"; org2 mega-sample split). mega_brzozowski_derivatives, VERIFIED on disk 11-10:\nMIGRATED (with test cells): lib/spiral/regex_* = 10 modules carrying real ///> cells (regex_certificate 47, regex_derivative 12, regex_dfa 13, regex_xsd 22, + charset/language/minimal/nullable/syntax/table). The engine + proofs are in lib. BUT REGEX-LEGACY-ABSORB audit = 9 absorbed / 20 partial / 42 MISSING of 71 modeling items -> absorption is INCOMPLETE.\nLEFT (as items): REGEX-PUBLISH (CI D1-D10 green on a pushed commit), REGEX-LEGACY-ABSORB (the 42 missing), REGEX-SEMANTICS-ORACLE, REGEX-ENGINES-LAZY-STAGED, REGEX-AUTOMATON-TYPESTATE, REGEX-CLOSURE-CERTIFICATES, LIB-VEC-FIN; 2 compiler samples (gadt_uninhabited_payload_runtime, gadt_rank_matrix) go to the compiler lane.\nDELETION PRECONDITION: 82 matrix.psd1 rows (verified count); family files = main.spi/fsx/zig/c, package.spiproj, bench.ps1, regex_crate_bench.rs, 67 subfolders; CONSUMERS (verified) = apps/compiler/tmp/tests/matrix.psd1 + apps/compiler/tmp/AGENTS.md + apps/compiler/scripts/bench-native.ps1. Gate = REGEX-PUBLISH green AND REGEX-LEGACY-ABSORB complete AND the native-at-scale bench role relocated (below) AND user go. Archive via scratch-archive.ps1 (never delete), dangling-check-by-stem first.\nROLE-REPLACEMENT per compiler's template (note the CONSTRAINT: compiler's SPS/CIC decision drops their native rows BECAUSE coverage \"stays with brzozowski/omniledger/zeta runtime rows\" -- so brzozowski is CURRENTLY the retained native-at-scale coverage and CANNOT drop its runtime rows on the same terms): (1) mega-suite compile entry -> the regex lib package as the compile-stress program; (2) runtime_native/Backends/Timeout rows -> KEEP until BACKEND-BENCH-CI absorbs the bench_* workloads; (3) bench-native.ps1 brzozowski runtime_native dir -> moves to BACKEND-BENCH-CI (bench_sieve/tree/strings/float); (4) canary: compiler-chosen compiler_probe_*/negative_* minimal samples stay. Next step: BACKEND-BENCH-CI must own the bench_* relocation before phase-A archive, else large-program native coverage is lost.")
inl regex_aot_targets () = Task ("REGEX-AOT-TARGETS", "regex AOT and targets (deferred track M5-M6, M8): staged no_std DFA, C header, prefilters + necessity certificate, UTF-8 byte automata, eBPF/WGSL, differential fuzz", Story, P2, D7, 0u32, Planned, "REGEX-REBAR", "regex,automata,team:org,main", "current", "current")
