inl note_of_x_typed_units_6 () = Note ("X-TYPED-UNITS", 6u32, "2026-11-10T10:41Z", "microblog-b7595ac3", "microblog 11-10 06:4x SPLIT ON DEMAND (user 06:0x: 'split should be done on demand ... advanced blocked items in the drafts while making sure we don't lose progress'). The light pool was 0 while this item's next step is authoring; slice 1 X-TYPED-UNITS-S1-PARSED-RECORD (light) drafts the parsed record in drafts\\x\\X-TYPED-UNITS. This parent keeps the medium node gate (one package per crate, linked units, every unit <= 1000 lines) and waits on its open child.")
