inl note_of_regex_legacy_absorb_15 () = Note ("REGEX-LEGACY-ABSORB", 15u32, "2026-11-09T15:21Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 11-09 15:2x DONE: all 7 children Done (NEGATIVES, PARTITION-COVERAGE, TYPED-CORE, C-TARGETS, UNIVERSAL-WITNESS, CLOSURE-BUDGET, STAGED-TABLES), each closed with its own proof note. The legacy material the 11-08 re-map listed is now absorbed: typed core + witnesses + negatives + coverage + C targets in regex/src (proven by the 87/87 full build, ganymede job-1794227421877), the staged table path with a reproducible emitter (same job, staged match line), and the closure cap in lib regex_dfa (landed 15:18, box lib 0CCCB6163BFA0636). Follow-on, not part of this item: regex/src still carries its own dfa/minimal/certificate/table copies, which REGEX-CRATE-UNITS replaces with imports of the lib modules REGEX-LIB-3 landed. Proof: the children's notes.")
