inl note_of_regex_pretok_1 () = Note ("REGEX-PRETOK", 1u32, "2026-11-02T11:29Z", "regex", "regex 07:5x FILED (DIRECTION-1031 candidate nerode-pretok, now an item). SOURCE: share re-read (subagent a7601c1fd3d1a599f), verbatim at %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\drafts\\regex\\REGEX-SOTA\\sota-reread-20261102.md; C = artifact cccab1fd. VERBATIM: 16. NEW REGEX-PRETOK: a cl100k/o200k pre-tokenizer. Start once spans (M3) exist; lookahead (?!\\S) is handled by derivatives, as RE# showed is possible. DoD: 0 divergences against tiktoken's token IDs on at least 1 GB of mixed text (code, CJK, emoji, pathological whitespace); the pre-tokenizer runs within 1.2x of toktok's hand-written one; end to end is at least 3x faster than tiktoken-rs. Cut: if the DFA exceeds 64k states, fall back to lookahead emulation (like tiktoken v3) and keep the proof only for the regular part. Timebox 4 weeks. Source: C §E(i), §F.3. NEXT STEP when started: pin tiktoken''s cl100k/o200k regexes and a 1 GB mixed corpus as CI downloads (never committed). TYPEFEATURESET PLAN: lookahead as a re constructor with its own derivative rule, refused by engines that cannot honor it.")
