inl note_of_cells_port_memo_8 () = Note ("CELLS-PORT-MEMO", 8u32, "2026-11-10T12:21Z", "microblog-b7595ac3", "microblog 11-10 12:2xZ slice D1 DONE (block_shape now runs in Spiral; memo.ex lost its regex parser; parity 134735/134735). The domain-export pattern is proven on a node: private Cells copy + box sources + gleam.toml/manifest.toml/src/templates/data, cases exported from the box. NEXT STEP: slice D2, the package-print side (compiled_blocks + with_stable_ids + package_index pure parts), with the same parity-oracle method.")
