inl cells_port_compiler_client () = Task ("CELLS-PORT-COMPILER-CLIENT", "Cells in Spiral C7a: compiler_client.ex (824 Elixir lines) speaks the daemon protocol through daemon.spi's landed 'request r' GADT (C4) instead of tab lines. Each call's reply type comes from its request, and the encoder/decoder pair is deleted when the Elixir caller goes. Oracle: compiler_daemon_test and warm_notebook_test pass, plus a CELLS-GATE corpus run with equal pass, fail and memo-hit counts", Story, P1, D5, 60u32, Paused, "CELLS-HTML-PARITY", "team:microblog,cells,cells-in-spiral,typefeatureset,beam", "current", "current")
