inl note_of_cells_port_compiler_client_7 () = Note ("CELLS-PORT-COMPILER-CLIENT", 7u32, "2026-11-09T19:17Z", "microblog-b7595ac3", "11-09 15:3x microblog RE-DECIDED: stays Paused. REASON: (1) its dep CELLS-HTML-PARITY is still Planned 55%; (2) the compiler client is untouched today, but the per-test protocol it speaks (SPIRAL_CELLS_PER_TEST) flips default-on only after the europa suite; the europa per-test full suite that proves those changes starts after tibia's QAT and reads out after 21:00 (CELLS-PORT-PER-TEST-PROTOCOL n14), so porting now would port Elixir that is still settling. RESUME CONDITION: CELLS-HTML-PARITY Done AND the europa per-test suite green; the port then starts from the post-fix Elixir.")
