inl cells_port_compiler_daemon () = Task ("CELLS-PORT-COMPILER-DAEMON", "Cells in Spiral C7b: compiler_daemon.ex (1,185), compiler_pool.ex (249), slots.ex (123), server.ex (87), memory_guard.ex (81) and file_lock.ex (65), 1,790 Elixir lines, become otp_actor processes on BEAM in Spiral. The pool and slots are typed state, and retire/idle-exit is a typed lifecycle (it absorbs CELLS-SERVER-EXIT-TAIL's end-to-end proof). The process name changes, so kit_machine_watch_model/model.spi:188 (Spiral.Cells.CompilerDaemon) is told in this slice. Oracle: compiler_daemon_test with its idle, retire-race and status tests, compiler_pool_test, slots_test, plus a CELLS-GATE corpus run with equal counts", Story, P1, D7, 0u32, Planned, "CELLS-PORT-COMPILER-CLIENT", "team:microblog,cells,cells-in-spiral,typefeatureset,beam", "current", "current")
