inl cells_scaling_bench () = Task ("CELLS-SCALING-BENCH", "Benchmark dib (dotnet-repl/fsi chain) vs Cells once and for all: per-cell cost as cell count grows (1..128 cells), per phase (parse, prefix compile, codegen, native build, run), on the 3 nodes; output = the ranked list of what to fix so long runs stay fast", Story, P1, D4, 0u32, Planned, "", "team:compiler,compiler,cells,perf,bench", "current", "current")
