inl note_of_dcolon_migration_lint_6 () = Note ("DCOLON-MIGRATION-LINT", 6u32, "2026-11-03T14:35Z", "compiler", "11-03 10:3x compiler: LINT JOINED THE LIB LAND GATE (unstaged, apps/cells/spi/lib_land_window.ps1, parse-checked). New close stage '=== respell_drift' after type_probe: runs the installed compiler's format --check --respell-drift on the landed .spi files only and fails the close (undo) on any ': respell-drift ' finding; formatting and over-120 lines from the same command are ignored. Verified: live lib reports 0 respell-drift findings (75 lines are over-120/would-change only), a probe file with sm'.length reports exactly one (\"respell-drift (write ::length for .length)\"), and the stage's command returned 0 for metrics.spi alone and 1 for metrics.spi plus the probe. Each lane heals its own repo; lib cannot drift back.")
