inl note_of_sps_notebook_split_4 () = Note ("SPS-NOTEBOOK-SPLIT", 4u32, "2026-11-09T23:08Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 11-09 23:0xZ consolidation proof: all nine kernel linear_* notebooks gated together against the full apps/kernel/src package on ganymede (job org2-kall; mirror = box by sha1): linear_types 2/2, linear_terms 4/4, linear_renaming 2/2, linear_substitution 2/2, linear_strengthening 2/2, linear_variable_strengthening 2/2, linear_reduction 3/3, linear_term_strengthening 3/3, linear_open_substitution 2/2 = 22/22, every rc=0. Children done: NB-1, NB-2 (tibia), NB-3 (rig), NB-4, NB-4B; NB-5 slice 1 (tibia). All unstaged in spiral.")
inl note_of_sps_notebook_split_5 () = Note ("SPS-NOTEBOOK-SPLIT", 5u32, "2026-11-10T05:29Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 11-10 05:3xZ first-pass terminal accounting (by terminal name vs kernel test intent, NOT body-checked; the 71 are the := *_terminal defs in apps/compiler/tmp/samples/mega_spiral_proves_spiral_relative_consistency/main.spi, none is named in apps/kernel). Likely COVERED (about 40): terms/usage (context_indexed_lambda, indexed_term, fully_used_term, all_used_usage_vector), renaming (variable_weakening, recursive renaming, renaming composition), context_strengthening, identity_substitution, open substitution variable/tensor_left/tensor_right/lambda_outer, conditional small/guard steps, beta_step, beta_reduction, open_beta_body families (4), open identity/tensor/application/lambda beta reductions, closed recursive beta derivation/canonical reduction/progress, tensor_left congruence, lambda shape canonicity, composite ready beta, progress authority, value, bool normalization. PENDING in tibia handoffs now gating (org2-nb6d3, then nb6d4): application_argument congruence + depth 3/4 + trace, closed_bool_program, normalizing_fragment, normalizing_progress_authority, no_closed_false, intrinsic_ready_frontier, tensor_right congruence. NO TEST FOUND (about 20, candidates for an NB-7 child): open substitution application_argument and application_function; weakened family (unit_bool_closed_tensor, unit_bool_weakened_tensor, bool_application_weakened, weakened_identity_lambda, two_step_weakened_identity_lambda, arbitrary_outer_lambda, outer_weakening_composition, outer_weakening_associativity); bool literal replacement (total, conditional), bool_negation_involution; nested_lambda_substitution, application_lambda_substitution (+ preservation); conditional_guard_preservation, reduction_preservation; closed_recursive_beta_conditional, shared_argument_counterexample; nonidentity_lambda_canonicity, atomic_tensor_beta_progress, bool_application_atomic_congruence; all_membership_spine; active_indexed_surface is the aggregate. Next step: after SPS-NB-6D-NORMALIZATION lands on the box, org2 body-checks each mapping and splits the uncovered set into a child item.")
