inl note_of_sps_mega_archive_2 () = Note ("SPS-MEGA-ARCHIVE", 2u32, "2026-11-07T22:19Z", "main", "main 11-07 groom. DoD: mega_spiral_proves_spiral_relative_consistency archived (never deleted, user go given) once SPS-NOTEBOOKS reaches parity (every module and every negative covered). Next step: none until SPS-NOTEBOOKS is Done; record it as a dep then.")
inl note_of_sps_mega_archive_3 () = Note ("SPS-MEGA-ARCHIVE", 3u32, "2026-11-10T11:00Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 groom 11-10: compiler decided the sample's compiler roles on KERNEL-AS-COMPILER-CORPUS: the Mega compile entries (Self, CIC) become one compile-only apps/kernel entry; runtime_native / all_terminals / Backends / 180 s Timeouts rows are dropped; the bench-native.ps1 dirs are dropped. ONE exception that touches this item: the type-layout canary stays as this sample's all_terminals on C only until a small extracted canary replaces it, so archiving this sample needs that extraction (or keeping that one row against an archived copy). compiler makes the matrix and bench-native edits once org archives the dirs, gated by one suite run")
inl fiscal_erp_generic () = Task ("FISCAL-ERP-GENERIC", "Rewrite the omniledger ERP mega sample as fiscal's generic layer: one canonical invoice/ledger/lifecycle pipeline over every generated schema family at once, new countries by a manifest row plus an instance", Epic, P1, D7, 45u32, Active, "FISCAL-ERP-REGIME-INDEX,FISCAL-ERP-MONEY,FISCAL-ERP-DOCUMENT-PROTOTYPES,FISCAL-ERP-ADAPTERS-ALL,FISCAL-ERP-P2P-TYPESTATE,FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER,FISCAL-ERP-EVENT-LOG,FISCAL-ERP-ALL-FAMILIES-PIPELINE,FISCAL-ERP-NEW-COUNTRY-DRILL", "team:fiscal,fiscal,erp,typefeatureset,mega-samples", "current", "current")
