inl note_of_fiscal_erp_generic_8 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-GENERIC", 8u32, "2026-11-08T12:57Z", "fiscal", "11-08 groom (user 11-08: groom until they are not stalled). STALL READ: no ERP child moved since 11-04 (5 Paused, 3 Planned). Causes: (1) every resume condition runs through landing regenerated code, and the full gate passed the 6 h cap 11-07 (healing: FISCAL-GATE-SCALE); (2) draft stacking; (3) a stale premise fiscal wrote 11-07 (no lib lands until pack61b is fleet-wide), false: fiscal landed two lib sets 11-07 23:12 and 23:32. CRITICAL PATH, one landing instead of two: the lib field-meta set (xsd_emit 673807F2 + xml_codec BD3C251F; their bases D00BE390 and EFAE1583 are still live) together with the fiscal drafts (generator 5FA6A206, families 2ACF1F66, lifecycle 4C061E89, family-gates A6B1FD05, modeling_ceiling 6AEEA43B; stack verified 11-08: each top draft holds every lower draft's added lines), one regen, one sharded gate (FISCAL-GATE-SHARD's first use). It unblocks FAMILY-MANIFEST then REGIME-INDEX then P2P; LIFECYCLE-EVENTS B2 then EVENT-LOG; the field descriptors then DOCUMENT-PROTOTYPES then ADAPTERS-ALL; and XSD-FACET-DIGITS then MONEY then LEDGER. Started 11-08 by fiscal.")
