inl note_of_fiscal_erp_generic_10 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-GENERIC", 10u32, "2026-11-08T18:24Z", "fiscal", "11-08 LANDING PROOF STATUS. Node gate on pinned pack61b (core 65DEE79CF2CF8B9F), 12 shards at P4: 99 of 100 units green; generated_nfe_v4 VOID (2 of 4 tests hit the size-scaled cell timeout under contention; see FISCAL-GATE-BUDGET n4). Pack62 format pass on the node (job-1794161617323, core 4524F0D8D0AABDEE): 83 of 83 units formatted, 0 failed, 0 changed, so the regenerated tree is pack62-stable and needs no re-gate. Evidence: node C:\\home\\remote-stage\\fiscal-erp\\out\\generated-units-pack62.tsv and format62-changed.txt (empty). BLOCKER: generated_nfe_v4 solo rerun with the cell timeout x2, chained after TRAIN41 (box job job-1794161786432-fiscal-nfe4-launch; node job fiscal-erp-nfe4). NEXT STEP: when nfe4 is green, run lib_land_window for xsd_emit 673807F2 + xml_codec BD3C251F on the box's pack62, dry run first; then copy in the drafts and the regenerated generated/, hash-checked against the node manifest (167 rows). The encke rental is postponed (cloud-provider account limits); its bundle stays on europa as 97067b81.")
inl note_of_fiscal_erp_generic_11 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-GENERIC", 11u32, "2026-11-08T19:24Z", "fiscal", "11-08 LIB LAND DRY RUN GREEN (box, lib_land_window.ps1, no -Apply). Drafts: xsd_emit.spi 673807F2 (FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-6-EMIT v1) and xml_codec.spi BD3C251F (FISCAL-MYINVOIS-SIGNATURE-TWIN v1). Base guards D00BE390 and EFAE1583. Result: both round-trip as document_test requires; 'dry run: nothing written'. BASE CHECK: of 145 top-level lib files, the node-gated lib.zip (EDAE423F) differs from today's live lib only in these 2 drafts, so the node gate (99 of 100 green) applies to today's lib exactly. Box queue: org2 layers.spi first, then this land on org's 'box lib-land yours'. NEXT STEP: generated_nfe_v4 solo rerun green (node job-1794164058430), then -Apply with the same arguments, then copy in the fiscal drafts + generated/ hash-checked against the node manifest.")
