inl note_of_fiscal_erp_money_1 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-MONEY", 1u32, "2026-11-02T12:25Z", "regex", "regex 08:2x SOURCE: read-only research by subagent a30fa65e0c5ec60b9 (11-02), recovered verbatim by main at %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\drafts\\regex\\GROOM-1102\\erp-report.md. User 11-02 07:46: \"tasks to fully rewrite the erp sample in fiscal, drawing every lesson and technique to write the generic code who tries to use all generated schemas at the same time, with more countries to come\". TYPEFEATURESET PLAN: ISO 4217 currency nominals; the FX route GADT (static existential middle currency); runtime rates as a closed union; rounding HalfUp | HalfEven | Floor chosen per regime (EN 16931 two decimals, NF-e TDec). DOD: generic parts in lib units/decimal; ''BRL + EUR does not type'' is a fails test.")
inl note_of_fiscal_erp_money_2 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-MONEY", 2u32, "2026-11-03T12:11Z", "fiscal", "2026-11-03 08:11 fiscal: MODEL DRAFTED AND TYPE-PROVEN (dep XSD-FACET-TYPES is for using money inside generated units; the model itself needs only lib decimal, so per the DoD 'generic parts in lib' it is a lib draft): %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\drafts\\spiral\\FISCAL-ERP-MONEY\\lib\\spiral\\money.spi (module after decimal). ISO 4217 phantom currencies (:! brl/eur/usd/mxn = ()) with a currency witness GADT; ':! amount c = decimal::decimal' with amount_of / value_of / plus (same currency only); ':! rate a b'; the FX route GADT 'Direct :: \\* a b. rate a b -> fx_route a b | Via :: \\* a b. (exists m. rate a m * rate m b) -> fx_route a b' (static existential middle currency, packed with 'exists (r1, r2)', opened with ':= exists m. first, second = packed'); ':| rounding = HalfUp | HalfEven | Floor' applied by 'rounded' (HalfUp agrees with decimal.round_to, ties toward +inf; HalfEven ties to the even neighbour; Floor via floor_division) and 'converted mode places route amount'. Tests: amounts_add_in_one_currency_and_convert_through_a_route (10 BRL at 0.17 = 1.70 EUR; via USD 0.18 x 0.92 = 1.656 -> 1.66), each_rounding_mode_breaks_ties_its_own_way, and the DoD negative brl_plus_eur_does_not_type fails \"Unification\". PROVEN on idle europa (pack24): --check exit 0; NEGATIVES as top-level probes both exit 5 'Unification failure': BRL + EUR, and a Via route whose legs do not meet (BRL->USD then EUR->EUR). Cells run of the 3 tests still to come (node, queued later). Regime rounding choice (EN 16931 two decimals, NF-e TDec) attaches when XSD-FACET-TYPES lands.")
inl note_of_fiscal_erp_money_3 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-MONEY", 3u32, "2026-11-03T16:07Z", "fiscal", "2026-11-03 12:07 fiscal: CELLS RUN QUEUED on the node as job-1793722029097-fiscal-money (after the xpath split job): draft money.spi 5B9C4F6F placed in the t1101 mirror lib with 'money' registered after 'decimal' in package.spiproj, lib_gate on money.spi with a pinned compiler copy, then both restored. PREDICTION: money 3/3 (the fails test included). On green the landing is the draft file plus one package.spiproj line.")
inl note_of_fiscal_erp_money_4 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-MONEY", 4u32, "2026-11-03T17:33Z", "fiscal", "2026-11-03 13:33 fiscal: LANDED UNSTAGED spiral lib/spiral/money.spi 5B9C4F6F (registered after decimal). Rust run: 2 bodies green. RUNTIME-PROVEN on europa before landing: test bodies compiled --backend Rust (pack24), rustc -O, run exit 0 (harness mutation-tested on durable_file: a flipped expectation exits 1); every fails negative proven alone (exit 5, pinned text). The queued node Cells job stays as confirmation; CI on the joint push is the final gate. Commit TOGETHER: spiral lib (money, ledger, event_log, durable_file + package.spiproj lines) and fiscal src (document, p2p, posting + package.spiproj and spiral.toml lines; fiscal posting needs lib ledger/money). tibia safety: a lib 'ledger' module does not hide tibia's own ':== ledger' record in apps/predict/sweep.spi (europa repro, exit 0 + non-vacuity exit 5).")
inl note_of_fiscal_erp_money_5 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-MONEY", 5u32, "2026-11-03T20:29Z", "fiscal", "2026-11-03 16:29 fiscal: LANDED THROUGH lib_land_window (label fiscal-lib-1103, closed green, undo spiral-bin\\lib-land-undo\\20261103-161039, lib digest 0B967D8878EF2C4A): signatures 0 consumer-used changed; apps/spiral compiles; document_test 22 passed; type_probe 4/4 (money 2, ledger 4, event_log 4, xsd_census 1 tests typed; 9 fails negatives skipped as designed); respell_drift 0 findings. Respelled before landing (exists -> \\?, fun -> \\, true/false -> !+/!-) and re-proven under pack27 on europa (check + bodies + pinned negatives + Rust runs). Unstaged in spiral. money.spi 0D68320D.")
