inl note_of_fiscal_erp_ledger_1 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER", 1u32, "2026-11-02T12:26Z", "regex", "regex 08:2x SOURCE: read-only research by subagent a30fa65e0c5ec60b9 (11-02), recovered verbatim by main at %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\drafts\\regex\\GROOM-1102\\erp-report.md. User 11-02 07:46: \"tasks to fully rewrite the erp sample in fiscal, drawing every lesson and technique to write the generic code who tries to use all generated schemas at the same time, with more countries to come\". DOD: the law ''journal balances and totals equal canon BT-112/BT-110'' holds for every family in one generic test.")
inl note_of_fiscal_erp_ledger_2 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER", 2u32, "2026-11-03T16:19Z", "fiscal", "2026-11-03 12:19 fiscal: CORE MODEL DRAFTED AND TYPE-PROVEN ahead of P2P (the journal needs only money): %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\drafts\\spiral\\FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER\\lib\\spiral\\ledger.spi 991FA763, a lib module after money. ':| side = Debit | Credit'; ':! line e p c = string * side * money::amount c' (entity, period and currency indices, the first two phantom); debit/credit; side_total over core listm::fold (it joins on a runtime list, so no EJP0040); ':! journal e p c = list (line e p c)' built only through 'balanced' (option) with a 'balances' predicate; turnover; 'intercompany revenue expense x : journal a p c * journal b p c' (from omniledger's opposed_mirror_pair: the seller's due-from and the buyer's due-to, both balanced by construction). Tests: a_journal_is_built_only_when_its_sides_balance, an_intercompany_sale_books_two_balanced_mirror_journals, and the negatives a_eur_line_does_not_join_a_brl_journal / a_buyer_journal_is_not_a_seller_journal, both 'fails Unification'. PROVEN on idle europa (pack24): module --check clean, test bodies clean, each negative alone gives exactly 'Unification failure' (amount eur vs amount brl; journal seller july_2026 brl vs journal buyer july_2026 brl). Cells run QUEUED: job-1793722745626-fiscal-ledger after the money job, PREDICTION 4/4. STILL OPEN for Done: tax lines per regime and projections per accounting standard (need FISCAL-ERP-DOCUMENT-PROTOTYPES and the regime index), and the law 'journal balances and totals equal canon BT-112/BT-110' over every family.")
inl note_of_fiscal_erp_ledger_3 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER", 3u32, "2026-11-03T16:54Z", "fiscal", "2026-11-03 12:54 fiscal: THE DoD LAW, DRAFTED AND TYPE-PROVEN over the drafts (lib money + ledger, fiscal document): %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\drafts\\fiscal\\FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER\\src\\posting.spi A9D9576D, destination fiscal/src/posting.spi after document. 'invoice_journal \\* e p c f {canon_of}. (currency : money::currency c) (doc : f) : option (ledger::journal e p c)' books receivable = BT-112 against revenue = BT-109 and tax payable = BT-110 through ledger::balanced, so 'journal balances' and 'BT-112 = BT-109 + BT-110' are the same law, written once for every {canon_of} family. Tests: a_reconciling_invoice_books_a_balanced_journal_of_its_bt_112 (turnover = BT-112) and a_brl_invoice_does_not_book_into_a_eur_journal (fails 'Unification failure'). PROVEN on idle europa (pack24, a deps tree whose lib carries money+ledger): module and bodies exit 0; the negative exit 5 with exactly Got option (journal _ _ brl) / Expected option (journal seller july_2026 eur). Cells run QUEUED: job-1793724790640-fiscal-posting after the p2p job (places money, ledger, document, posting; restores in a finally), PREDICTION 2/2. With the generated-family instances (DOCUMENT-PROTOTYPES DoD) the same test covers UBL / NF-e / CFDI without new code.")
inl note_of_fiscal_erp_ledger_4 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER", 4u32, "2026-11-03T17:00Z", "fiscal", "2026-11-03 13:00 fiscal: PERIOD CLOSE MOVED from omniledger (erp_close / close_certificate, listed STILL TO MOVE in OMNILEDGER-ARCHIVE n3): ledger.spi now 6A740078 (re-uploaded to the node before its queued job started; the job's prediction is updated to 6/6). ':! open_period e p c = list (journal e p c)', ':! closed_period e p c = list (journal e p c) * decimal' (the certificate carries the period turnover), opened / post / close / period_turnover. Tests added: a_closed_period_certifies_the_turnover_of_its_journals, and a_closed_period_takes_no_more_journals (fails Unification; europa: exactly Got closed_period seller july_2026 brl / Expected open_period seller july_2026 brl). posting.spi re-checked against the new ledger: exit 0. Accounting-standard projections (the mega sample's gaap_projection) remain open.")
inl note_of_fiscal_erp_ledger_5 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER", 5u32, "2026-11-03T17:05Z", "fiscal", "2026-11-03 13:05 fiscal: EPOCH-INDEXED SETTLEMENT FX MOVED from omniledger (settlement_fx_route source target epoch, STILL TO MOVE in OMNILEDGER-ARCHIVE n3), placed in ledger because the epoch is the ledger's period: ledger.spi now 3A96F956 (re-uploaded before its job; prediction 8/8). ':! quote a b p = money::rate a b', 'quoted', and 'revalued \\* e p a b. mode places (quote a b p) (journal e p a) : option (journal e p b)' (each line converted through money::converted with a Direct route, then re-balanced, because rounding per line can unbalance; the caller then books a rounding line). Tests: a_journal_is_revalued_with_a_quote_of_its_own_period (100 BRL at 0.17 = 17 EUR both sides) and a_july_journal_takes_no_august_quote (fails Unification; europa: Got journal _ august_2026 brl / Expected journal seller july_2026 brl). posting.spi still exit 0 against it.")
inl note_of_fiscal_erp_ledger_6 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER", 6u32, "2026-11-03T17:34Z", "fiscal", "2026-11-03 13:33 fiscal: LANDED UNSTAGED spiral lib/spiral/ledger.spi 3A96F956 (after money) and fiscal src/posting.spi A9D9576D (after p2p). Rust run: ledger 4 bodies, posting 1 body green. RUNTIME-PROVEN on europa before landing: test bodies compiled --backend Rust (pack24), rustc -O, run exit 0 (harness mutation-tested on durable_file: a flipped expectation exits 1); every fails negative proven alone (exit 5, pinned text). The queued node Cells job stays as confirmation; CI on the joint push is the final gate. Commit TOGETHER: spiral lib (money, ledger, event_log, durable_file + package.spiproj lines) and fiscal src (document, p2p, posting + package.spiproj and spiral.toml lines; fiscal posting needs lib ledger/money). tibia safety: a lib 'ledger' module does not hide tibia's own ':== ledger' record in apps/predict/sweep.spi (europa repro, exit 0 + non-vacuity exit 5).")
inl note_of_fiscal_erp_ledger_7 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER", 7u32, "2026-11-03T19:33Z", "fiscal", "2026-11-03 15:33 fiscal: CLOSE CERTIFICATE PER STANDARD MOVED (omniledger close_certificate entity period standard; gaap_projection's index): landed unstaged in ledger.spi -> 03083793 (formatted). Phantom standards ':! ifrs / us_gaap / br_gaap = ()' with a witness GADT ':| standard s = Ifrs :: standard ifrs | UsGaap :: standard us_gaap | BrGaap :: standard br_gaap'; ':! certificate s e p c = closed_period e p c'; 'certified (standard s) (closed_period e p c) : certificate s e p c' and certified_turnover. Test a_closed_period_certifies... also checks an IFRS certificate's turnover (80 BRL); new negative an_ifrs_certificate_is_not_a_us_gaap_certificate (fails Unification; europa: Got certificate ifrs seller july_2026 brl). PROVEN on europa: check with bodies exit 0, all 5 negatives exit 5, 4 Rust bodies exit 0, posting still exit 0 against it. confirm-landed2 inbox + prediction updated (ledger 9/9). Still open: per-standard account mapping (a chart of accounts per standard) once a real fiscal consumer needs it.")
inl note_of_fiscal_erp_ledger_8 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER", 8u32, "2026-11-03T20:29Z", "fiscal", "2026-11-03 16:29 fiscal: LANDED THROUGH lib_land_window (label fiscal-lib-1103, closed green, undo spiral-bin\\lib-land-undo\\20261103-161039, lib digest 0B967D8878EF2C4A): signatures 0 consumer-used changed; apps/spiral compiles; document_test 22 passed; type_probe 4/4 (money 2, ledger 4, event_log 4, xsd_census 1 tests typed; 9 fails negatives skipped as designed); respell_drift 0 findings. Respelled before landing (exists -> \\?, fun -> \\, true/false -> !+/!-) and re-proven under pack27 on europa (check + bodies + pinned negatives + Rust runs). Unstaged in spiral. ledger.spi 08BA2385.")
