inl note_of_fiscal_erp_ledger_10 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER", 10u32, "2026-11-03T22:17Z", "fiscal", "2026-11-03 18:17 fiscal: TAX LINES PER REGIME (DoD), unstaged in fiscal src/posting.spi 96F037F4: 'tax_account \\* r. (regime : families::regime_witness r) : string' is a total match on the regime witness GADT from FISCAL-ERP-REGIME-INDEX (Brazil -> 'ICMS a recolher', EuropeUbl -> 'VAT payable', Mexico -> 'IVA trasladado por pagar'; a new regime case fails to compile until it names its account); invoice_lines takes the tax account; regime_journal (regime) (currency) (doc) books BT-110 to that regime's account, invoice_journal keeps the neutral 'tax payable'. Test each_regime_books_tax_to_its_own_account (a Brazilian invoice's journal lines are exactly receivable / revenue / ICMS a recolher). PROVEN on europa (pack27, lib with money+ledger): check with bodies exit 0, the brl/eur negative unchanged, both bodies as Rust exit 0.")
