inl note_of_fiscal_erp_ledger_16 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER", 16u32, "2026-11-10T10:24Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "fiscal groom 11-10 07:0x: READY. Both deps are Done (FISCAL-ERP-MONEY closed 11-10 06:3x with the regime-indexed amount windows; FISCAL-ERP-P2P-TYPESTATE closed 11-09), and tonight's p2p landings add what a ledger posts from: typed purchase events with a frame codec, and a match decision carrying its evidence (order, currency, supplier, amounts). Next step: draft the double-entry posting over money's currency-indexed amounts (a posting is balanced per currency by construction; a negative test that an unbalanced or mixed-currency posting does not type), following the OMNILEDGER-ARCHIVE n8 checklist row for the ledger.")
inl note_of_fiscal_erp_ledger_17 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER", 17u32, "2026-11-10T11:19Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "fiscal 11-10 08:3x DRAFT (the DoD's generic law on REAL family documents): drafts\\fiscal\\FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER\\posting.spi F0909F5A over live CBEE84E5. posted_totals {net; tax; gross}; totals_lines posts receivable gross / revenue net / tax payable tax in a currency-indexed journal; law_holds = the journal balances (ledger::balanced) and turns over BT-112. Readers: ubl_totals_of (LegalMonetaryTotal TaxExclusiveAmount = BT-109, TaxTotal TaxAmount = BT-110, TaxInclusiveAmount = BT-112) over the 10 official EN 16931 TC434 UBL examples; cfdi_posted over canon_derived's stamped-CFDI totals. Tests: the 4 EUR examples (1, 8, 9, 10) book typed EUR journals of their BT-112; the 6 NOK/DKK/SEK examples satisfy BT-109 + BT-110 = BT-112 at the decimal level (lib money has no NOK/DKK/SEK, recorded as a gap, not hidden); the SAT-stamped CFDI books a typed MXN journal. NF-e is OUT of this slice: ICMS is 'por dentro' (included in the price), so its posting needs its own rule (follow-up). Cell budget 4 -> 4, lib_roundtrip canonical. Box gate queued after the event_log consumer gate (calm-box rule; overlay added only after that gate so an unproven draft can't contaminate it). Next step: record the posting gate's verdict; on green, land posting.spi and split the NF-e por-dentro rule into its own item.")
inl note_of_fiscal_erp_ledger_18 () = Note ("FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER", 18u32, "2026-11-10T12:38Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "fiscal 11-10 08:3x PROVEN AND LANDED. ganymede gate job-1794312384062-fiscal-gany-gate (first fiscal package gate on ganymede: node-proof mirrors of spiral + fiscal matching the box trees incl. unstaged, corpus shipped once as a tarball, pinned compiler copy, memo off, build.ps1 -Files currency,posting,lifecycle,p2p -Parallel 1 -NoGateCache): p2p 39/39, lifecycle 16/16, currency 17/17, posting 6/6, all failed 0; posting.spi F0909F5A: 6/6 including every_eur_en16931_example_books_a_balanced_journal_of_its_bt_112 (official TC434 examples 1, 8, 9, 10 as typed EUR journals), the_other_currency_examples_satisfy_the_decimal_law (examples 2-7, NOK/DKK/SEK; lib money has no typed NOK/DKK/SEK yet) and the_stamped_cfdi_books_a_balanced_journal_of_its_bt_112 (typed MXN). Copied over live CBEE84E5 (unstaged); undo in drafts\\fiscal\\FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER\\undo-20261110-083129. The DoD law now holds on real family documents for EN 16931 and CFDI; Brazil's por-dentro ICMS needs its own posting rule, split as FISCAL-LEDGER-NFE-POR-DENTRO. Next step: none; Done.")
