inl note_of_transformer_gpu_8 () = Note ("TRANSFORMER-GPU", 8u32, "2026-11-09T03:16Z", "tibia", "11-08 23:1x tibia: pause re-decided, stays Paused. Reason: the provider refused every rental on 11-08 (deposit, monthly fee limit, no GPU locations). The user then shelved the CPU rental and said a GPU rental may go OUTSIDE that provider later. A non-provider GPU is a direction, not a permission (gpu-rental-permission). Resume when: the user names the GPU provider, cap and account, OR the current provider lists a GPU location and its account gates (deposit, fee limit) admit a $20 run. Depends on GPU-STACKED-RUNS resuming first.")
