inl note_of_transformer_gpu_10 () = Note ("TRANSFORMER-GPU", 10u32, "2026-11-10T07:47Z", "tibia", "11-10 03:5x tibia: pause re-decided, stays Paused, with the reason CORRECTED. The standing user permission (memory gpu-rental-permission, 11-02) still covers Vultr GPUs up to $20; what blocks is stock, not a missing provider. An anonymous recheck now (GET /v2/plans?type=vcg and /v2/plans-metal, no key): 3 cloud GPU plans and 9 bare-metal GPU plans, 0 with any location, the same as on 11-04. A non-Vultr GPU is still a direction, not a permission (user 11-08). Resume when: a Vultr GPU plan lists a location in the anonymous query, or the user names another provider, cap and account.")
