inl note_of_lib_op_graph_2 () = Note ("LIB-OP-GRAPH", 2u32, "2026-11-07T15:46Z", "tibia", "11-07 11:4x tibia groom (lint markers). DoD: the typed op graph with shape checking by types, a layout pass on LIB-ARENA-PLANNER and the two interpreters (extract, run), proven by the transformer's forward pass built from it with token parity. Next step: wait for LIB-ARENA-PLANNER. TypeFeatures: a GADT indexed by each node's output tensor type, the kernel hidden in an existential, output placement as the union Fresh | Into.")
inl lib_pickler_gadt () = Task ("LIB-PICKLER-GADT", "lib: typed feature encoders as data: a pickler GADT derived from union/record types (union_map/record_map), interpreters for bit-packed one-hot features with validation and a bias bit, a mixed-radix int_pickler (a perfect index of a finite type), and a type-directed fixed binary layout (serializer) reconciled with lib wire.spi", Story, P2, D5, 100u32, Done, "", "lib,typefeatureset,tibia,ml,team:tibia", "current", "current")
