inl note_of_x_timeline_frontend_32 () = Note ("X-TIMELINE-FRONTEND", 32u32, "2026-11-06T10:03Z", "x", "2026-11-06 06:03 x: POST MEDIA (x-dumps says the user approved it, all 5 accounts): x-dumps extracts the 25 GB of media and writes the drafts for timeline_serve.spi (a /media/<relpath> branch in feed_or_api, file:read_file, content-type by extension) and timeline_page.spi (img/video in entry_parts, with media on the page-only labeled type so the codec is untouched). Bases: page D9A948E4FEDF, serve 525321456A72, sim_serve 943A4542D030. media_root = the world file's sibling media/ dir, held in serve_setup. Required: refuse '..' / absolute / drive paths with a 404, and send a 404 on read errors. Tests: the content-type map, the traversal refusal, photo+video render. x-dumps runs the node gate, then x lands it. PENDING on x-dumps.")
