inl cic_env_index () = Task ("CIC-ENV-INDEX", "kernel environment as an index, not a list: find_decl scans list decl linearly (about 1800 declarations by the end of Init.Prelude), so the export replay takes 20 min per run on europa; a persistent map keyed by name (lib dict or a hash trie) for lookups, keeping admission order where the kernel needs it", Story, P4, D4, 0u32, Planned, "CIC-LEAN-EXPORT-REPLAY", "lean,kernel,typefeatureset,team:org,main", "current", "current")
