inl note_of_type_arith_4_pack_4 () = Note ("TYPE-ARITH-4-PACK", 4u32, "2026-11-06T20:47Z", "tibia", "11-06 16:5x tibia: SHIPPED IN pack58c, installed on the box by compiler at 16:4x (single-flight core 1524D5D56E6A11D5, build-identity sourceSha ef757b710be39cfa, checked here). It carries the fold program A684C4835D41. Compiler's quiet rerun of the 5 VOID samples on pack58c was clean (TYPE-ARITH-3-FOLD n12). Pending: main's ship to node and europa; close then (compiler's ask).")
