inl note_of_xdumps_harvest_enrich_1 () = Note ("XDUMPS-HARVEST-ENRICH", 1u32, "2026-11-06T11:03Z", "x-dumps", "Filed 11-06 from the engagement battle-test (user asked: can engagement be fetched?). ANSWER: yes for likes+replies via syndication (parser gap, proven), no for rt/quote/view (authed-API only). DONE: live.rs::summarize extended + proven on fc1943s 22-tweet sample. REMAINING: (1) deploy the live.rs change to europa xarchive; (2) re-run live stage across reachable accounts (fc1943s/i574n/stewshka) - Cache::Immutable means re-parse from cache, little re-fetch; (3) thread new fields through parse.rs Row + world.rs + typed codec; (4) surface in UI (likes/replies, un-shortened links, author name/avatar). Coordinate codec/UI with x. Suspended accounts stay tombstoned.")
inl note_of_xdumps_harvest_enrich_2 () = Note ("XDUMPS-HARVEST-ENRICH", 2u32, "2026-11-06T11:17Z", "x-dumps", "ENRICHMENT ROLLOUT started on europa 11-06 11:16Z (heavy->europa per run rules; load 0.56, 2GB free). Enriched live.rs deployed box->europa (hash a4ecaacba283 match), xarchive rebuilt there RC=0 11.4s (systemd scope MemorySwapMax=0). Re-harvest RUNNING as xa-enrich.service: xarchive /data/x live fc1943s i574n stewshka, re-fetching ~4362+ unique ids (no response cache, so real re-fetch, rate-limited, ~couple hours). write_atomic per account = interrupt-safe (old live.ndjson preserved until new ready). Monitor: journalctl -u xa-enrich. NEXT after it completes: verify enriched fields in live.ndjson, rebuild joined world (xarchive world/merge), then UI/codec threading with x. Progress 25->40.")
inl note_of_xdumps_harvest_enrich_3 () = Note ("XDUMPS-HARVEST-ENRICH", 3u32, "2026-11-06T11:27Z", "x-dumps", "DATA-LAYER THREADING DONE + PROVEN 11-06. Extended timeline.rs (READ_FIELDS 17->28 + record emit via live_val/pick) so enriched fields survive slim into timeline.ndjson; world.rs post_of does r.clone so they pass through to joined.world.json unchanged. Verified end-to-end on box battle-test: timeline.ndjson 22/22 carry favorite_count max 11456 (17 nonzero), conversation_count, lang (all 22), urls/hashtags/mentions, author_verified (5), media_dims. timeline.rs deployed+built on europa RC=0. Re-harvest xa-enrich RUNNING: fc1943s 200/4362 (~2s/tweet, ~3.7h for 3 accounts). NEXT (heartbeat): on xa-enrich done, run timeline+merge+world on europa -> enriched joined world. Sub-gaps noted (not blocking): author_name uses wayback-title logic (not live user.name, preserved for authorship labeling); world.rs:52 media alt_text hardcoded empty. UI slice ready to author when drafts unfreeze (coord x): likes/replies in byline, linkify entities.urls, lang badge. Progress 40->60.")
inl note_of_xdumps_harvest_enrich_4 () = Note ("XDUMPS-HARVEST-ENRICH", 4u32, "2026-11-06T12:15Z", "x-dumps", "UI SLICE authored + cell-budget-green 11-06 (in media-quote-draft, layered on media): engagement display. timeline_page: post_meta {likes,replies} on page-only labeled (via with_meta so existing labeled_of calls unchanged), counts_markup renders '<N> likes - <M> replies' line when nonzero, hidden when zero. timeline_serve: int_field + post_meta_of read favorite_count/conversation_count off the term (safe default 0 via offset_of). Tested: render-when-nonzero + hidden-when-zero. So the full enrichment is now capture(live.rs)->thread(timeline/world)->re-harvest(running)->DISPLAY(authored). Draft hashes timeline_page 2717F63EEA60, timeline_serve E8B9C4A05015. Links-in-text display deferred (t.co dedup). Needs: base media land + enriched world rebuild + serve gate. Progress 60->80.")
inl note_of_xdumps_harvest_enrich_5 () = Note ("XDUMPS-HARVEST-ENRICH", 5u32, "2026-11-06T12:26Z", "x-dumps", "UI slice extended 11-06: language badge added (post_meta.lang via with_lang setter, no meta_of churn; lang_badge renders a <span class=lang> for non-English tweets, hidden for en/empty). Flags PT/KO tweets - relevant to the multilingual accounts + the parked translation feature. Tested (pt renders, en hidden). media-quote-draft now: media+quoted-media+Range+engagement-counts+lang-badge, all cell-budget --granular 0 over_budget, lines<=120. Clean display slices done; author-name/avatar + inline-links deferred (retweet-authorship / t.co-dedup complications, resolve post-land). Progress 80->85.")
inl note_of_xdumps_harvest_enrich_6 () = Note ("XDUMPS-HARVEST-ENRICH", 6u32, "2026-11-06T12:29Z", "x-dumps", "Deferred-display-slice design notes 11-06 (so they're done right post-land, not forced now): (1) AUTHOR AVATAR - author_avatar is a pbs.twimg.com URL; displaying it means per-tweet external requests to Twitter CDN (privacy leak for a local archive) OR download avatars to serve locally first (new harvest step, like post media). Decision needed; not clean. (2) AUTHOR DISPLAY NAME - timeline.rs derives author_name from wayback page titles (authorship-sensitive, gated on captured_near), not live user.name; surfacing live's name needs care vs the repost/own-words labeling. (3) INLINE LINKS - entities.urls expand t.co; rendering them risks duplicating the t.co already in text (needs text-rewrite, not just append). CLEAN slices DONE: likes/replies counts + language badge (pure data, no external deps). These 3 want decisions against real landed data; filed here, not stacked speculatively.")
inl note_of_xdumps_harvest_enrich_7 () = Note ("XDUMPS-HARVEST-ENRICH", 7u32, "2026-11-06T12:36Z", "x-dumps", "World-rebuild command CORRECTED 11-06 (caught a real bug in the heartbeat before it fired): the enriched joined world is built by the world stage (world.rs -> <root>/joined/joined.world.json), NOT merge. merge re-renders per-account timelines + folds shared-handle accounts (the dup @fc1943s case). Correct post-re-harvest sequence on europa: xarchive /data/x timeline fc1943s i574n stewshka (per-account, takes handles) -> xarchive /data/x merge (root only, no handles) -> xarchive /data/x world (root only). Earlier heartbeat ran only \timeline merge (missing world) + passed handles to merge -> would have produced NO joined world. Fixed in cron 07ec3c1a. Enriched world lands on EUROPA at /data/x/joined/joined.world.json; box-transfer to the :8787 serve + engagement DISPLAY are gated on x landing the media chain, so it stays on europa as durable capture until then.")
inl note_of_xdumps_harvest_enrich_8 () = Note ("XDUMPS-HARVEST-ENRICH", 8u32, "2026-11-06T12:44Z", "x-dumps", "DATA-LOSS RISK caught + mitigated 11-06 (important): the enrichment re-harvest returns only CURRENTLY-ALIVE tweets; fc1943s had 2350 alive originally but the re-fetch finds only ~1425 (~900 DECAYED/suspended since the first capture). run() REPLACES live.ndjson, so rebuilding from it would destroy the captured content of the ~900 decayed tweets. Mitigation DONE: preserved pre-enrich backups on europa (fc1943s live 2350/timeline 4570, i574n 599/1289, stewshka 874/1732 lines) BEFORE the overwrite. Heartbeat 4b9bd4de now MERGES new-enriched over pre-enrich by id (new wins for alive, old content kept for decayed) before timeline->merge->world, and verifies merged count ~= pre-enrich count. New durable principle: [[reharvest-must-merge-not-replace]]. This also VALIDATES the original harvest's value: tweets are decaying (~38% of fc1943s's once-alive set now gone), so capturing-before-decay + backups were exactly right.")
inl note_of_xdumps_harvest_enrich_9 () = Note ("XDUMPS-HARVEST-ENRICH", 9u32, "2026-11-06T13:50Z", "x-dumps", "fc1943s re-harvest COMPLETE 11-06 13:42Z: ids=4362 alive=2350 gone=2012 (8723s). CORRECTION to the earlier decay scare: alive=2350 EXACTLY equals the pre-enrich count, so fc1943s had ZERO net decay - all originally-captured tweets are still live and now enriched; the 2012 gone were already dead at the ORIGINAL harvest, not decayed-since. The mid-run alive=1425 plateau was just the dead middle id-range; the recent tail recovered fully. (The merge-overlay safety net was still the right call - it guarantees no loss regardless, and matters if i574n/stewshka show any real decay.) Re-harvest now on i574n (then stewshka), ~1h left. Merge+rebuild (heartbeat) pending all 3 done. fc1943s merge will be a clean 2350=2350.")
inl note_of_xdumps_harvest_enrich_10 () = Note ("XDUMPS-HARVEST-ENRICH", 10u32, "2026-11-06T14:21Z", "x-dumps", "STEWSHKA RECOVERY finding 11-06 (re-harvest does more than enrich): stewshka re-fetch is ~99% alive (199/200, gone=1), projecting ~1380 alive at 1386 ids vs the ORIGINAL live.ndjson of only 874. So the re-harvest is RECOVERING ~500 stewshka tweets the original run MISSED (likely original pending/rate-limit failures; the re-run with cache/retry gets them). The merge-overlay union keeps all (merged m>pre is GOOD, not loss). Heartbeat a0dd283b guard semantics corrected: m>=pre required, m>pre = recovered-missed = proceed, only m<pre = abort. Net run value so far: fc1943s no decay (2350=orig, enriched), stewshka +~500 recovered + enriched, i574n ~599 enriched. Confirm exact counts when stewshka completes (~30min) and the merge runs.")
inl note_of_xdumps_harvest_enrich_11 () = Note ("XDUMPS-HARVEST-ENRICH", 11u32, "2026-11-06T14:51Z", "x-dumps", "CORRECTION to the stewshka-recovery claim: the earlier '~500 recovered' was extrapolated from the first 200 ids (99% alive) and does NOT hold. At 1200/1386 stewshka alive=747, projecting ~840 final vs original 874 = roughly FLAT (likely ~tens decayed or ~equal), not a big recovery. So the re-harvest's net = enrichment (engagement/entities/lang) + fc1943s 0-decay confirmation; stewshka is ~flat, not +500. The merge guard m>=pre handles m==pre fine (no harm from the earlier projection). Exact per-account final counts at completion (~6min) -> will finalize in XDUMPS-DECAY-RECOVERY-REPORT. Don't carry '+500 stewshka' into the final report; use the measured numbers.")
inl note_of_xdumps_harvest_enrich_12 () = Note ("XDUMPS-HARVEST-ENRICH", 12u32, "2026-11-06T15:07Z", "x-dumps", "ENRICHED WORLD BUILT + VERIFIED 11-06 14:5xZ on europa (/data/x/joined/joined.world.json, 116M vs orig 113.6M). Re-harvest done (fc1943s alive=2350=orig/0-decay, i574n ~595, stewshka alive=870~=orig 874). MERGE-OVERLAY done per account (content-complete + enriched): fc1943s 2358 lines (2350 enriched + 8 preserved), i574n 600 (595+5), stewshka 872 (868+4). GUARD NOTE: stewshka first ABORTed (merged 872 < pre LINES 874) - a FALSE POSITIVE: the pre-enrich had 874 lines but only 872 DISTINCT ids (2 dup ids); union=872 is correct+complete. The guard should compare DISTINCT ids, not line count. Verified distinct, re-merged stewshka manually. Rebuild timeline->merge->world: posts=163317 (+11), unrecoverable=4860. VERIFIED enrichment in world: 2365 posts with nonzero likes (top 1,111,695 likes), 4925 lang-tagged, conversation_count + quote-media/entities present. Data-layer enrichment COMPLETE. Box-transfer + :8787 engagement DISPLAY still GATED on x landing the media chain; enriched world stays on europa as durable capture. Progress 85->95.")
inl note_of_xdumps_harvest_enrich_13 () = Note ("XDUMPS-HARVEST-ENRICH", 13u32, "2026-11-07T15:58Z", "x-dumps", "dod: engagement counts, lang, author, entities and media-dims from syndication are captured in the world and render across a deep joined-timeline page-walk. next: confirm media-dims (w/h) surface in the UI and finish author/entity rendering; re-harvest must merge not replace.")
