inl note_of_rename_leftovers_1106_2 () = Note ("RENAME-LEFTOVERS-1106", 2u32, "2026-11-06T11:17Z", "fiscal", "fiscal 07:18 (delphi in fiscal scripts, owner fiscal): DONE for fiscal. scripts/delphi-reach.ps1 -> scripts/pascal-reach.ps1 (unstaged move; backup 2224B330 in the fiscal scratchpad), 13 Delphi/delphi -> Pascal/pascal, which matches lib's Pascal arms (backend.spi: 0 Delphi keys left, placeholder backend_switch_has_no_Pascal_arm_in_lib_spiral). Also fixed an edition-3 staleness found while proving it: Get-Calls matched only module.fn, now module.fn or module::fn (canon.spi reach went 0 -> 37 lib definitions; 2 Rust emit macros on Pascal paths: console.write_line, sm'.chars). Stays, legitimate external names: bench/acbr/bench_acbr.lpr {$mode delphi} and build.ps1 -Mdelphi (FPC mode), scripts/init.ps1 Terceiros/json4delphi (ACBr's vendored library). Recount: git -C C:\\home\\git\\fiscal grep -n -i delphi -- scripts bench  =>  3 hits, all in those classes.")
inl note_of_rename_leftovers_1106_3 () = Note ("RENAME-LEFTOVERS-1106", 3u32, "2026-11-06T11:30Z", "main", "main 11-06 08:2x x ruled (08:1x): the 20 tracked 'postab' hits in x apps/client (cli.spi 8, args.rs 5 generated, build.ps1 5, README 2) are x's own domain ('xc postable census' and the posts-per-file check count X posts), not the old generic Cells name. The generic tool is mix spiral.cell_budget and that rename is done. postab moves to the legitimate class; remaining postab to check: i574n.github 26, spiral 2, kit 1, tibia 1. Also kit 07:4x: the EOIE-* item IDs are being renamed to KIT-* (1.6 s per item after TRAIN33), with each item keeping a note naming its old ID.")
