inl note_of_fiscal_cii_profiles_2_families_2 () = Note ("FISCAL-CII-PROFILES-2-FAMILIES", 2u32, "2026-11-10T02:49Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "fiscal 11-09 23:0x DRAFTED in the kit drafts store (not in the tree yet), kit drafts fiscal\\FISCAL-CII-PROFILES-2-FAMILIES\\families.spi 4D55B1BF over live 6A44ED14: helpers facturx_schema, facturx_bare (bare_family with root CrossIndustryInvoice / CrossIndustryInvoiceType, namespace urn:un:unece:uncefact:data:standard:CrossIndustryInvoice:100) and facturx_1_09_2 (record update: one example, GateResolve because the profile XSDs import their urn_un_unece type modules by relative path), then facturx_profiles () with five units generated_eu_facturx_{minimum,basicwl,basic,en16931,extended}_1_09_2, each with one example whose GuidelineSpecifiedDocumentContextParameter matches its profile (minimum, basicwl, #compliant#basic, en16931:2017, #conformant#extended); registered in all_families; the two count tests move 45 -> 50 families and 43 -> 48 gate-table lines. BLOCKER: the package is email-gated, so init.ps1 skips it on CI; landing these families in all_families would make CI's regen and the generated/ drift check fail where the corpus is absent. Needs a user decision on how CI gets the package (see the user batch). NEXT STEP: once decided, prove on a node (regen + the five unit gates) and land in the tree.")
inl note_of_fiscal_cii_profiles_2_families_3 () = Note ("FISCAL-CII-PROFILES-2-FAMILIES", 3u32, "2026-11-10T02:54Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "fiscal 11-09 23:3x draft v3 176BD9C9 (supersedes 4D55B1BF) is budget-neutral and canonical: code overages 31 = live 31, round trip canonical. Shape: cii_space and cii_root (the shared CII root: CrossIndustryInvoice / CrossIndustryInvoiceType / urn:un:unece:uncefact:data:standard:CrossIndustryInvoice:100), facturx_schema (folder from the profile index), facturx_module, facturx_documents, facturx_1_09_2 (record update with one example and GateResolve), one definition per profile (facturx_minimum, _basic_wl, _basic, _en16931, _extended), facturx_profiles in all_families, counts 50 families / 48 gate-table lines. Lesson again: the here-string dropped the blank line before all_families and merged two cells; check the joint by eye.")
