inl note_of_fiscal_lib_granular_6_emit_2 () = Note ("FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-6-EMIT", 2u32, "2026-11-06T16:50Z", "fiscal", "12:5x DRAFT xsd_emit.spi 673807F2 STACKED on the field-meta draft 79A50432 (kit drafts spiral FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-6-EMIT\\v1), by a fiscal subagent, VERIFIED by fiscal: europa GRANULAR 37 -> 0 code overages; all 6 field-meta pieces kept; LF; round trip with the twin xml_codec BD3C251F PASSED; agent --check lib xsd_emit + fiscal generator 0; format --check 0 (one test's literal re-split, layout only). 114 emit_-prefixed helpers (unused in lib, fiscal/src, fiscal/generated). Agent's least-certain spots for emitted text: once_sequence items vs Sequence { occurs = occurs_once (); items }; the attribute_step writing record update; dereferenced_in's Element rebuild. PROOF QUEUED: arms 'fm' (79A50432 + BD3C251F) and 'g6' (673807F2 + BD3C251F) added to node job-1793981107602-fiscal-identity3 (hash-verified before start): g6 vs fm must be byte-identical over all 166 files; fm vs live reports the field-meta text change (expected). TYPEFEATURES: none new.")
