inl note_of_dice_granular_3_ui_1 () = Note ("DICE-GRANULAR-3-UI", 1u32, "2026-11-06T21:59Z", "main", "Split from DICE-GRANULAR-HEAL (360 min > 240; census 11-06 18:0x: 148 sites, up from 79). Leptos component files. DoD: as slice 1. Next step: list which are Leptos view! glue (deliberate) vs text/number formatting (heal to sm'). TypeFeatures: typed records for RPC payloads instead of host struct macros.")
inl note_of_dice_granular_3_ui_2 () = Note ("DICE-GRANULAR-3-UI", 2u32, "2026-11-10T07:11Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 11-10 07:1xZ sites by kind (21): 15 HEAL, static class attributes written as raw macros ($'class=...' text): dice_view 12 (6 th + 6 td), content 1, menu_tabs 1, transactions_view 1. Healed to a new typed lib helper leptos.class (classes : string) : string, built like tag_closed_raw, so the view! text still folds to the literal. 2 DELIBERATE host, reason each: content.spi:30 compares a Rust String (hash == empty) inside a Rust expression; settings_view.spi:15 is serde_json::to_string_pretty over the global state. Proof (ganymede job org2-dg3, pinned compiler, mirror sources = box by hash): dice ui main.rs regenerated before and after; all 203 class attributes are the same multiset, line counts equal (14509), and after normalizing generated identifier numbers and let mut the diff is EMPTY. The raw diff is only temporary renumbering from the helper's binding, so not byte-identical but semantically identical. Lib helper proof running as org2-lep (lib land of leptos/leptos.spi). Next step: after org2-lep is green, org2 lands leptos.spi on the box, then copies the four dice components.")
inl note_of_dice_granular_3_ui_3 () = Note ("DICE-GRANULAR-3-UI", 3u32, "2026-11-10T07:28Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 DONE, proof: (1) lib leptos.class landed on the box copy-only from ganymede job org2-lep (close green, type-probe PASS, lib digest 9DFC1430F38FAC4F): lib/spiral/leptos/leptos.spi 4766bfa0f040. (2) The 15 class sites in dice/ui/src/components (dice_view 12, content 1, menu_tabs 1, transactions_view 1) now call leptos.class, unstaged in dice. Consumer proof (job org2-dg3): main.rs regenerated before and after has the same 203 class attributes, equal line counts, and an empty diff after normalizing generated identifier numbers and let mut. Not byte-identical, because the helper's binding renumbers temporaries; the committed main.rs refreshes on the next dice ui build. The 2 remaining host sites are deliberate (content.spi:30 Rust String compare, settings_view.spi:15 serde_json).")
