inl note_of_toml_format_taplo_8 () = Note ("TOML-FORMAT-TAPLO", 8u32, "2026-11-08T01:09Z", "fiscal", "11-07 21:1x EXECUTED (box, core 65DEE79CF2CF8B9F pack61b): a_long_package_list_wraps_like_taplo from fiscal generator draft 5FA6A206 compiled and ran alone, exit 0. NEGATIVE CONTROL (same tree, wrap threshold raised to 1000 so nothing wraps): run exit 1 with 'past 120 columns each entry takes its own line', so the test pins the wrapping. Remaining: the regen that rewrites generated_cfdi_v4_0/spiral.toml and the CFDI generator test, with fiscal's next generator landing (node).")
inl note_of_toml_format_taplo_9 () = Note ("TOML-FORMAT-TAPLO", 9u32, "2026-11-08T05:16Z", "main", "USER 11-08 01:0x: wants the same benefit WITHOUT a committed .taplo.toml per repo. Moved to ORG-CONFIG-SINGLE-SOURCE (rig-shipped formatter config or a generated one). Don't add .taplo.toml to more repos meanwhile.")
