inl note_of_regex_core_into_lib_4 () = Note ("REGEX-CORE-INTO-LIB", 4u32, "2026-11-11T01:06Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 groom 11-10: this parent showed 0% Planned and surfaced as ready work, but its chain is well along: REGEX-LIB-1-CHARSET-SYNTAX, -2-DERIVATIVES and -3-DFA are Done (lib/spiral now carries regex_charset, regex_syntax, regex_nullable, regex_derivative, regex_dfa, regex_minimal, regex_xsd), -4-XSD-GAPS is Active at 15%, -5-SWITCH is Planned. Per the 11-08 split the parent closes when step 5 does, so it waits on item REGEX-LIB-5-SWITCH; progress set to the chain share")
