inl note_of_conv_world_model_1 () = Note ("CONV-WORLD-MODEL", 1u32, "2026-11-07T15:10Z", "main", "Child of CONVERGENCE-LAB (n3 amendment); shares the tibia lane with TIBIA-GRADIENT-POLICY. The simulator gives unlimited exact transitions, so prediction error is checkable against the true next state. DoD: latent prediction error and probe accuracy for the true next state on held-out seeds; a planner that searches over actions in latent space, scored on the BENCHMARK held-out seeds against BC, PG, ES and CEM at an equal simulator budget, pre-registered.")
inl note_of_conv_world_model_2 () = Note ("CONV-WORLD-MODEL", 2u32, "2026-11-07T15:11Z", "main", "Next step: after CONV-JEPA-OBJECTIVE and TIBIA-BC-POLICY, define the latent next-state predictor's input (state, action) and check each predicted transition against the simulator's exact next state; then planning by search in latent space at an equal simulator budget.")
