inl note_of_conv_frontier_page_1 () = Note ("CONV-FRONTIER-PAGE", 1u32, "2026-11-07T15:39Z", "main", "Child of CONVERGENCE-LAB (n6). DoD: a CI job evaluates the current best checkpoint (a CI download, never committed) on the pinned suite, appends typed rows, and renders the frontier; each ablation arm (backbone, ternary, selective scan, gated compute, typed encoder, decision head, curricula) is a row with its delta; the page states plainly whether the frontier is reached.")
inl note_of_conv_frontier_page_2 () = Note ("CONV-FRONTIER-PAGE", 2u32, "2026-11-07T15:40Z", "main", "Next step: after CONV-SOTA-TARGET pins the benchmark set and comparison models, add a gh-pages job that runs the harness on every arm, plots accuracy against CPU time per answer and weight bytes with the Pareto frontier, reports calibration (ECE, Brier) beside each point, and prints one line saying whether the target is reached.")
