inl note_of_lib_drop_rename_forwards_3 () = Note ("LIB-DROP-RENAME-FORWARDS", 3u32, "2026-11-09T11:43Z", "microblog-b7595ac3", "11-09 caller census (microblog, CPU-light; dep X-NAMING-BATCH3-SWITCH is Done). rg over every repo .spi + .spir, excluding target/ and deps/. READY TO DELETE (0 callers outside their own definitions): dict.spi:83 size, dict.spi:127 set_size, erlang_term.spi:96 length_of. dict.spi:79 is an unrelated Gleam stdlib macro (dict.size), not a caller. NOT YET: file_system.spi:2042 read_dir_names still has 3 callers: dir-tree-html tree/tree.spi:26, alphabet apps/documents/documents.spi:287, html html_walk/walk.spi:29 (all in the old dotted spelling file_system.read_dir_names). NEXT STEP for org (owner): land the 3 ready deletions in one lib_land_window (off-box recipe: -PrivateLib proof on moon, then -ProvenLog on the box); keep read_dir_names until those 3 repos switch. Their owners need a respell, so ask first.")
inl note_of_lib_drop_rename_forwards_4 () = Note ("LIB-DROP-RENAME-FORWARDS", 4u32, "2026-11-09T11:48Z", "tibia", "11-09 07:5x tibia (taken as a READY item from team org, per org2's idle rule): CALLERS-ZERO verified on the box tree. No qualified call to dict::size, dict::set_size, erlang_term::length_of or file_system::read_dir_names in any *.spi under C:\\home\\git (the only hit is backlog text). The one repo that opens one of those modules unqualified (fiscal src/fiscal_paths.spi, :< file_system) never calls them. No lib-internal callers (dict.spi's $'dict.size(!d)' is count's Gleam host call, not the forward). Dep X-NAMING-BATCH3-SWITCH is Done. DELETED (unstaged, in the box spiral working tree; none of the 3 files had other WIP): dict.spi size + set_size, erlang_term.spi length_of, file_system.spi read_dir_names (9 lines). Wait: job ganymede:job-1794224820408-tibia-lib-forwards (--check of the 3 modules on the synced spiral mirror).")
inl note_of_lib_drop_rename_forwards_5 () = Note ("LIB-DROP-RENAME-FORWARDS", 5u32, "2026-11-09T12:04Z", "tibia", "11-09 08:1x tibia: the first check (job ...-tibia-lib-forwards) was VOID. The ganymede spiral mirror still held the forwards (definition counts 2/1/1), because -SpiralMirror only links and never syncs lib edits. The 3 edited files were scp'd to the mirror (counts now 0/0/0) and the check re-runs as job-1794225779005-tibia-lib-forwards2.")
