inl note_of_delegate_8_completion_1 () = Note ("DELEGATE-8-COMPLETION", 1u32, "2026-11-07T17:36Z", "compiler", "11-07 compiler groom of GENERIC-NODE-DELEGATION (user: any work delegates to nodes with minimal friction). DoD: a lane can start a job and be told when it finishes (a box-side status file with an age plus a cross-session notice), with no long-lived ssh wait (main: backgrounded ssh job wait; resilience: ssh-chain orphans on timeout). started_ms vs queued_ms are separate fields (tibia: started_ms counted queue time).")
inl note_of_delegate_8_completion_2 () = Note ("DELEGATE-8-COMPLETION", 2u32, "2026-11-07T17:39Z", "kit-fc1568a6", "11-07 kit groom markers. NEXT STEP: the node job writes a completion record that the box picks up (iggy event or a pulled marker) instead of a blocking ssh wait; split started_ms from queued_ms in the job record. TYPEFEATURESET PLAN: completion event as an iggy event GADT case, timing record with two nominal ms fields.")
inl delegate_9_memo () = Task ("DELEGATE-9-MEMO", "delegate memoizes results by (snapshot hash, core hash, command): an identical rerun returns the stored result", TaskKind, P0, D3, 0u32, Planned, "DELEGATE-6-RESULTS,DELEGATE-4-CORE-PIN", "team:rig,infra,node,delegation", "current", "current")
inl planning_of_delegate_9_memo () = Planning ("DELEGATE-9-MEMO", Minutes 120u32, Load Light, Assigned Agent)
inl note_of_delegate_9_memo_1 () = Note ("DELEGATE-9-MEMO", 1u32, "2026-11-07T17:36Z", "compiler", "11-07 compiler groom of GENERIC-NODE-DELEGATION (user: any work delegates to nodes with minimal friction). DoD: rerunning an unchanged gate returns instantly with a \"memo\" marker and the original job id (fiscal ask); any input, core or command change misses. VOID results are never memoized.")
inl note_of_delegate_9_memo_2 () = Note ("DELEGATE-9-MEMO", 2u32, "2026-11-07T17:39Z", "kit-fc1568a6", "11-07 kit groom markers. NEXT STEP: key each finished delegate result by (snapshot hash, core hash, command) and return the stored result on an identical request; never store a VOID result. TYPEFEATURESET PLAN: memo_key record of three nominals, memo verdict union (Hit, Miss, VoidNotStored).")
inl delegate_10_never_list () = Task ("DELEGATE-10-NEVER-LIST", "delegate refuses the never-delegate class by type: live box tree writes, backlog state, installs/pins, git, credentials/identity, and any placement on pluto", TaskKind, P0, D3, 0u32, Planned, "REMOTE-EXEC-S5", "team:rig,infra,node,delegation", "current", "current")
inl planning_of_delegate_10_never_list () = Planning ("DELEGATE-10-NEVER-LIST", Minutes 90u32, Load Light, Assigned Agent)
inl note_of_delegate_10_never_list_1 () = Note ("DELEGATE-10-NEVER-LIST", 1u32, "2026-11-07T17:36Z", "compiler", "11-07 compiler groom of GENERIC-NODE-DELEGATION (user: any work delegates to nodes with minimal friction). DoD: union of the 7 lanes' never lists as a typed rule set extending S5's WritesLiveTree: apply/land/install/pin, docs/backlog/state writes, git commit/stage/push, stored secrets (Cloud key, GPU rental, X API creds), anything behind the user's identity, keep/undo decisions, live GUI windows, profile/critical mirror writers, sshd restarts, WSL bash. pluto has zero placement (relay only).")
inl note_of_delegate_10_never_list_2 () = Note ("DELEGATE-10-NEVER-LIST", 2u32, "2026-11-07T17:39Z", "kit-fc1568a6", "11-07 kit groom markers. NEXT STEP: extend S5 WritesLiveTree into a typed never-delegate class: live box tree writes, backlog state (docs/backlog/state and archive, kit-locked), installs into the box bin, anything needing the box GUI; rustdesk gets zero placement. Refuse at request parse time. TYPEFEATURESET PLAN: never_class union, refusal carries the class.")
