inl note_of_block_memo_token_key_1 () = Note ("BLOCK-MEMO-TOKEN-KEY", 1u32, "2026-11-07T19:08Z", "compiler", "11-07 compiler: split from COMPILER-MEMO-DESIGN (candidate c). Today wdiff_parse memoizes by block identity, so a re-indent or a respell that only moves text re-parses and re-infers the block. DoD: in a warm daemon, a formatter-only edit of a lib file re-infers 0 blocks (counted), hovers and diagnostics land at the shifted ranges, outputs byte-identical. NEXT STEP: count re-inferred blocks per edit in a server-tcp session over a formatter respell of lib/spiral/optionm'.spi. typefeatureset plan: the key is a typed record (token kind, text) list, never concatenated text.")
