inl note_of_kit_next_name_13 () = Note ("KIT-NEXT-NAME", 13u32, "2026-11-11T04:18Z", "compiler", "11-11 compiler groom (user 11-11: why are we still using kit instead of rig? heal this also). The binary is still kit.exe because no train installed since TRAIN41 (11-08): TRAIN42e/43/43b/43c/43f/44 went red, TRAIN44b is in its release step on moon (KIT-RELEASE-TRAIN 272). Meanwhile about 40 new KIT- ids were filed after the decision. Filed RIG-NEW-ID-PREFIX-GUARD (P0, D1) to pull the R8 guard ahead of R7; renamed compiler KIT-WARNINGS-FIX to RIG-WARNINGS-FIX. Next step: R2 on TRAIN44b install (rig lane, unchanged), then the guard in the following train.")
