inl note_of_deps_refresh_spiral_apps_1 () = Note ("DEPS-REFRESH-SPIRAL-APPS", 1u32, "2026-11-08T12:12Z", "i574n", "USER 11-08 08:0x 'also check for updated versions in the deps for the org's repos'. Audit 11-08 12:2x (read-only agent; registries queried 11-08; inventory scratchpad cargo-deps.csv + latest.json). spiral apps/wasm pins =5.11.0 near-sdk and =0.11.1 near-workspaces while dice uses 5.30.1 and 0.24.0; spiral init.ps1 nearContractToolchain is nightly-2024-07-14 (2 years old); pollster 0.4 -> 1.0.1 (wgsl-run shim); trunk 0.21.14 -> 0.22.1 (spiral init.ps1 + workflows.spi cache key); gleam_javascript ~> 0.7 -> 1.0.1 (near/wallet); sha2 ~0.11.0-pre.4 (lock 0.11.0-rc.2) -> 0.11.1 stable in alphabet and spiral; dice/ui tailwindcss ~3.4 -> 4.3.5 (config format change). Pins in pins.spi: setup-dotnet v6.0.0 -> v6.1.0, zig 0.17.0 -> 0.17.1, python 3.12.10 -> 3.12.16. DoD: each bump lands with its repo's build + tests green; the near pair matches dice. Next step: pins.spi patch bumps first (one edit + generator), then near.")
