inl note_of_kit_typed_boundary_h2_1 () = Note ("KIT-TYPED-BOUNDARY-H2", 1u32, "2026-11-08T12:26Z", "rig-fc1568a6", "DoD: every export of the family H1 names carries model-unit types (rules 1-3), its callers no longer split or parse text, the census shows fewer wire exports and native lines, the probe links lines prove the links, and it rides one train under the gate. NEXT: wait for H1's ranking, then cut the model unit. TYPEFEATURES: the family's own unions and records, moved into the model unit with one anchor export each.")
inl note_of_kit_typed_boundary_h2_2 () = Note ("KIT-TYPED-BOUNDARY-H2", 2u32, "2026-11-09T18:44Z", "rig-fc1568a6", "11-09 22:0x local rig, DESIGN from H1's ranking (family #1: rig_agile_records_as_lines, 28 callers by H1's count). Mapped today: only 4 files call the export directly (agile_memory_links, agile_todo_scan, rig_handoff_render, and agile_task_text.model.records_text); the other callers reach it through records_text, a one-line forward in agile_task_text: 21 files (agile_claim_rank, agile_planning_rollup, agile_claim_item, agile_note_seal, agile_note_edit, agile_planning_migration, agile_planning_revision, agile_title_notes, agile_team_work, agile_todo_roots, agile_todo_record, agile_team_lane, agile_task_revision, agile_task_rename, rig_resume, agile_task_notes, agile_task_inspection x2, agile_task_listing, agile_task_next, agile_task_creation). WHAT CROSSES THE WIRE: records_as_lines (rig_agile_records/model.spi:59) rejoins formatter-split records into one line each and returns ONE newline-joined string; every caller then splits it again and parses fields out of text. PLAN, two steps, one train each: (1) the model unit exports the records as array_base string (one element per record, rule 2 typed array export) and records_text callers stop re-splitting on newlines, byte-identical behaviour proven by the existing three tests plus a per-caller compare; (2) callers that parse Task fields move onto typed rows from agile_quality_facts (already parses fact_row records), retiring the text parse at each site. Sequencing: after TRAIN43 snapshots, in the same post-train change set as the CLI prelude switch, since both rewrite the same agile packages.")
inl star_unblock () = Task ("STAR-UNBLOCK", "Starred unblock: the star exchange evolves from sharing lessons to advising across lanes; each lane reads the other lanes' Blocked and waiting items and offers a concrete unblock (an action, a technique, a re-verified premise, or a hand-off)", Feature, P1, D3, 50u32, Active, "", "lanes,star-exchange,unblock,flow,team:org", "current", "current")
