inl rig_units_u5 () = Task ("RIG-UNITS-U5", "units input from the compiler: the adapter is replaced by the compiler-emitted unit graph (LINK-WITHOUT-MANIFEST)", TaskKind, P1, D3, 0u32, Planned, "", "units,typed-units,standards,typefeatureset,team:rig", "current", "current")
