inl note_of_html_1_0_dod_1 () = Note ("HTML-1-0-DOD", 1u32, "2026-11-09T04:41Z", "org2", "Filed by org2 11-09 for ORG-VERSIONING. DoD (1.0 holds when ALL hold): (1) typed-units/1 layout: DONE 11-08 (7 units with entries named after the unit, unique module stems, template = typed-units/1 in the root Cargo.toml); (2) gates green: DONE 11-08 (Cells 30/30 + build HTML-OK on ganymede, job-1794192253339); (3) CI green on both OSes: DONE (gh-pages tests on 4ab01fc2, ubuntu-24.04 + windows-2025); (4) release binaries for both OSes: HTML-CI-RELEASE (blocked on the user's OK for the release job); (5) html replaces dir-tree-html in every caller: HTML-ADOPT-REPOS (the shim is switched in spiral, unstaged; proof job-1794198133061 pending; then the user's spiral push). Then the user tags v1.0.0 (publishing is the user's go). Next step: the deps close.")
inl note_of_html_1_0_dod_2 () = Note ("HTML-1-0-DOD", 2u32, "2026-11-09T04:43Z", "org2", "DoD: html meets typed-units/1, its Cells gate and build are green, CI is green on ubuntu and windows, release binaries for both OSes are attached by HTML-CI-RELEASE, and HTML-ADOPT-REPOS has replaced dir-tree-html in every caller; then the user tags v1.0.0. Next step: HTML-ADOPT-REPOS's shim proof job-1794198133061.")
inl note_of_html_1_0_dod_3 () = Note ("HTML-1-0-DOD", 3u32, "2026-11-09T06:43Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "Proof: shim proof on ganymede inconclusive (exit 1 from the spiral CLI cuda run check, host lacks the cuda child; html itself not reached). See HTML-ADOPT-REPOS note 11-09.")
inl note_of_html_1_0_dod_4 () = Note ("HTML-1-0-DOD", 4u32, "2026-11-09T08:56Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 11-09 07:4x condition (5) proven on Linux: the html shim proof is green (HTML-ADOPT-REPOS, job-1794207704602, 696 s, dist/html). Left: (4) release binaries (HTML-CI-RELEASE, the user's OK) and the user's spiral push for (5); then the user tags v1.0.0. Next step: none for lanes until the user acts.")
