inl note_of_fiscal_lib_granular_6a_emit_1 () = Note ("FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-6A-EMIT", 1u32, "2026-11-09T07:01Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "Slice of FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-6-EMIT (11-09 measurement, note 7 there). DoD: the cell_budget counter reports 0 code overages in this weight band on xsd_emit; regen identity (generated output byte-identical, like the 11-06 g6 vs fm 166/0 check); lib gate green. Land through lib_land_window.")
inl note_of_fiscal_lib_granular_6a_emit_2 () = Note ("FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-6A-EMIT", 2u32, "2026-11-09T09:19Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "NEXT: after its dependency lands, run mix spiral.cell_budget on a node over the live xsd_emit, list this slice's weight 273-350 (134 definitions) code overages, and draft helper extractions on the live file (one xsd_emit draft at a time), then lib gate + regen identity + land from a proven close. TYPEFEATURES: none new; output-neutral splits (extracted helpers keep the same types; no new string-keyed lookups).")
inl note_of_fiscal_lib_granular_6a_emit_3 () = Note ("FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-6A-EMIT", 3u32, "2026-11-09T10:51Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "11-09 FIRST DRAFT (kit drafts spiral FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-6A-EMIT v1 xsd_emit.spi 11A11A04 over live 0888893E; canonical round trip). Live had 242 code overages, 1 above the morning baseline of 241: step 3's helpers merged into one cell with emit_element_witness (the PowerShell here-string that inserted them dropped the final newline, so the blank line between cells was lost: base_witness weighed 672) and the exampling instance crossed 272 at 280. Fix + 6A start: base_fragment now takes (kind, t); a general tagged_witness (owner, tag, field, t, fragment, occurs) builds every field witness; plain_witness = tagged_witness with an empty tag; base_witness, emit_element_witness and emit_choice_witness are each one call; example_base_line slims the exampling instance; the cell blank line is restored. Code overages 242 -> 238 (3 under the morning baseline). Gate (xsd_emit full suite, 37 tests) on moon job-1794221458800. 6A remaining: ~130 definitions at weight 273-350 (list regenerable by the counter).")
inl note_of_fiscal_lib_granular_6a_emit_4 () = Note ("FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-6A-EMIT", 4u32, "2026-11-09T11:02Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "11-09 v3 GATING (kit drafts spiral FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-6A-EMIT v3 xsd_emit.spi 790F6F6B over live 0888893E; moon job-1794222114739-fiscal-g6a-gate4, full xsd_emit suite). Code overages 242 -> 225 (17 fewer, 16 under the morning baseline). Contents: v1 = the step-3 regression fix (cell blank line restored; tagged_witness/plain_witness; base_fragment (kind, t); example_base_line) plus the parse fix (a record update needs a variable: bind := w = ... then { w ?| ... }); v2/v3 = local parameter renames in 13 definitions (core_functions_of, emit_referenced_case, emit_attribute_references, emit_optional_attribute_part, functions_group, collected_with, emit_group_runs_read, element_arm reading, emit_alias_conversions, white_space_normalizer, fixed_example, identical_names, emit_staged_example_records). Gates v1/v2 were stopped in favor of the superset (a stop skips the moon script's restore, so the tree's xsd_emit was re-copied from live before the next run). RENAME TRAPS caught by reading every block: a regex rename also hit a record LABEL (collected_with's references field), and the label-safe rule then skipped an EQUALITY test (m against collapse); in Spiral text x = y is ambiguous, so read each renamed block by hand. Next after green: land from a proven close (re-sync the moon tree to the box digest first), then the rest of 6A by helper extraction.")
inl note_of_fiscal_lib_granular_6a_emit_5 () = Note ("FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-6A-EMIT", 5u32, "2026-11-09T11:36Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "Wait: job moon:job-1794222114739-fiscal-g6a-gate4")
inl note_of_fiscal_lib_granular_6a_emit_6 () = Note ("FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-6A-EMIT", 6u32, "2026-11-09T12:39Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "11-09 BATCH 1 LANDED: live xsd_emit 790F6F6B (base 0888893E). Gate: moon job-1794222114739 xsd_emit 37/37, type errors 0 (78 min under TRAIN42 load). Land: moon proof job-1794227155336 on a tree re-synced to the box (5 files had moved on the box since the last sync: dict, erlang_term, file_system, keccak, sm'), closed green (0 consumer signatures changed, apps/spiral compiles, document_test 26 passed, type probe PASS 37, respell drift 0, digest F873745B1D261F7F); box -ProvenLog = copy only, digest equal. Code overages 242 -> 225 (the step-3 regression fixed, plus 16 under the morning baseline of 241). Slice 6A remaining: about 117 definitions at weight 273-350 (regenerate the list with the counter on 790F6F6B). Next batch: helper extractions in groups of 10-20, one gate each; read every renamed block by hand (record labels and equality tests look alike).")
inl note_of_fiscal_lib_granular_6a_emit_7 () = Note ("FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-6A-EMIT", 7u32, "2026-11-09T12:55Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "11-09 BATCH 2 GATING: kit drafts spiral FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-6A-EMIT b2 xsd_emit.spi F739D364 over live 790F6F6B (canonical round trip). Code overages 225 -> 218 via local renames in 10 definitions (emit_shared_step match binder value_set -> vs; versioned_read_line module_name -> m; coded_enumeration, dfa_item, coded_text, union_parse_text normalizer -> norm; versioned_family_text versions -> vs; state_arms, dfa_function_head, dfa_function_text function_name -> fname); every block read by hand (record labels name/text untouched, field access item::value_set untouched). Gate: moon job-1794228919045. Still at 273-299 needing real splits, not renames: staged_field_types, emit_staged_of_children, coded_example_head, emit_reading_choice_head, emit_nodes_lines, witness_walk_lines and ~15 more.")
inl note_of_fiscal_lib_granular_6a_emit_8 () = Note ("FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-6A-EMIT", 8u32, "2026-11-09T14:50Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "11-09 BATCH 2 LANDED: live xsd_emit F739D364 (base 790F6F6B); gate 37/37 on moon (101 min under shared load), proof job-1794235136848 green on a tree re-synced exactly to the box (layers/process changed and physics.spi removed by org2 since the last sync; the removal was mirrored), digest 4F55A7C588BF586E, box copy-only. Code overages 225 -> 218. BATCH 3 GATING (b3 CA3C5300 -> A5F0C4C2, canonical): staged_wrap helper (parameters named before/after: a local named open is a parse trap), lower_index helper for upper_first, n binding in coded_example_head, renames in module_kinds_items (complex_types -> cts) and emit_recursive_attributes (attributes -> line); new names checked against the whole lib; 218 -> 213.")
