inl note_of_kit_memory_model_m2_2 () = Note ("KIT-MEMORY-MODEL-M2", 2u32, "2026-11-09T23:44Z", "rig-fc1568a6", "11-09 19:5x rig, EVIDENCE over the real memory dir (646 files besides MEMORY.md), with the model's own rule mirrored in a read-only PowerShell text pass (the compiled Spiral import was NOT run: the box takes no compute while the user is present, and the files are personal, so they are not copied to a node): (1) ROUND TRIP: 646 of 646 files rebuild byte for byte under memory_of_text / text_of_memory's rule (open mark raw, frontmatter lines, close mark raw, body), including the 20 files with CRLF endings (the marks keep their CR) and 0 with a BOM; (2) TYPED STORE: kinds feedback 490, reference 92, project 64, user 0; stored_of would admit 595 and refuse 51, every refusal a feedback or project memory without both **Why:** and **How to apply:** (e.g. archive-never-delete, audiobooks-lost-2026-10-28, autonomous-iteration-playbook, backend-switch-idiom, box-crash-recovery-playbook): real non-compliance with the memory convention, which rig_memory_check can report once its verb exists. DoD left: run the compiled import over the dir (box after the user leaves, a few seconds), which then closes M2.")
inl note_of_kit_memory_model_m2_3 () = Note ("KIT-MEMORY-MODEL-M2", 3u32, "2026-11-09T23:48Z", "rig-fc1568a6", "11-09 19:5x rig, REFINED the kind rule after reading the 51 refusals (unstaged, rig_memory_typed/memory.spi; re-gated green 3/3, its consumer rig_memory_check 1/1): 6 of them were not missing reasons but wrote QUALIFIED headings (**How to apply (do this BEFORE ...):**, **How to apply - diagnose ...:**, **Why it matters:**), which the exact-token match rejected. kind_rule_met and reasons_of now accept a heading that starts with **Why or **How to apply and read the text after that heading's closing **, so **Why:** x still reads x; a new test case covers a qualified pair. Refusals over the real dir: 45 (was 51), each a feedback or project memory with no Why and/or no How section at all (29 lack both, 12 lack only Why, 3 lack only How, 1 has a variant How but no Why): real gaps the memory owner fills in place, not a model artifact.")
