inl note_of_kit_do_slop_gate_m2_2 () = Note ("KIT-DO-SLOP-GATE-M2", 2u32, "2026-11-09T21:43Z", "rig-fc1568a6", "11-09 rig: tibia drafted the wiring (drafts\\kit\\KIT-DO-SLOP-GATE-M1\\: rig_do_edit run.spi slop_refusal after the existing problem/untouched/emptied checks, the rig_do_slop package + link, the rig-do-slop Cargo dependency, and rig_do_slop as a src workspace member; bases in M1 note 4). M1 is Done (model probe-green). Applying it is held until after TRAIN43 snapshots: it changes rig_do_edit (951 of 1000 generated lines), Cargo.toml and the lock, so it needs its own regen, lock and crate-gate proof and must not ride unproven into TRAIN43; it goes with TRAIN44's change set.")
