inl note_of_kit_memory_features_m1_4 () = Note ("KIT-MEMORY-FEATURES-M1", 4u32, "2026-11-09T14:41Z", "rig-fc1568a6", "11-09 11:1x local rig, MODEL BUILT (unstaged, unprobed; in the post-TRAIN42e probe batch): src/rig_job_liveness/liveness.spi, pure, HostFree. liveness union Progressing | SilentFor minutes | Unwatched (no limit set); output_mark record { bytes; changed_ms } advanced by mark_after when stdout+stderr bytes grow; liveness_of mark now limit gives SilentFor once quiet minutes >= the limit; a clock behind the mark is not silence. liveness_word for receipts (\"silent=12m\"). NEXT STEP after the probe: job start --silent-limit <min> writes <job>/silent_limit; the job host or job list advances <job>/output_mark from the two log sizes and prints silent=Nm in job list and job wait (the wait returns early on Silent with its own exit word).")
