inl note_of_md_lines_compiler_1 () = Note ("MD-LINES-COMPILER", 1u32, "2026-11-09T16:09Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "DoD: md-census -Repos spiral -List shows 0 prose lines over 120 under apps/compiler, git diff --word-diff shows 0 changed words. Next step: run md-census -List for spiral and reflow tmp/AGENTS.md first (most lines). Method (proven 11-05..11-09 on 9 repos): call %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\drafts\\i574n.github\\MD-LINE-LIMIT-120\\md-reflow.ps1 IN-PROCESS (& path -File <f> -Lines <n,...> [-Apply]; pwsh -File splits an array arg), splits only at spaces, never inside inline code or link text, list continuations keep their indent, and the rejoined text must equal the original (0 changed words). Tables, URLs, fences, verbatim third-party texts and raw-HTML lines are exempt. List the lines with md-census.ps1 -Repos @('<repo>') -List. TypeFeatures: none (text-only). Parent: MD-LINE-LIMIT-120 (split by org2 11-09 to put each lane's share in its own pool).")
inl note_of_md_lines_compiler_2 () = Note ("MD-LINES-COMPILER", 2u32, "2026-11-09T16:41Z", "compiler", "11-09 compiler: DONE (unstaged, nothing staged). md-census -Repos spiral -List: 0 prose lines over 120 under apps/compiler (was 151: tmp/AGENTS.md 84, tmp/lanes/hopacsota/PLAN.md 57, tmp/README.md 2, samples READMEs 7). git diff --word-diff over the 6 files: 0 changed words; the only non-word change is one added > continuation marker (tmp/README.md:21, a blockquote, split by hand). Pass 1 = md-reflow.ps1 in-process (128 lines). Pass 2 = 23 lines md-reflow could not split because a long parenthetical spans the whole width: same splitter, but parentheses only block a cut inside a link target ](...), never prose; inline code only as a last resort (CommonMark renders a line ending inside a code span as a space), rejoin check per line. Left as-is by the DoD: tables 23, fences 7, url 1. Outside scope: apps/cells/README.md:210 (a 174-char usage synopsis in one code span).")
