inl note_of_showcase_s5_reflection_diffs_2 () = Note ("SHOWCASE-S5-REFLECTION-DIFFS", 2u32, "2026-11-09T19:37Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "Samples written: reflection_diffs (invoice record, changes derived by real_core::record_fold_back over { state key value }, field names via sm'_real::symbol_to_string_real, values via ++#?; exit = total length of the change lines, expected 44 = 'total_cents: 1990 -> 2490' + 'paid: false -> true') and reflection_diffs_type_negative (diffing an invoice against a 2-field record). Budget clean. Rust attempt reflection_diffs/rust_attempt.rs on ganymede rustc 1.102.0-nightly: 2x error[E0599] no method named fields found for reference &T (no field reflection without a proc-macro crate). Next step: suite rows from job org2-s4b (filter decimal_scales|reflection_diffs, -Backend C,Rust).")
inl note_of_showcase_s5_reflection_diffs_3 () = Note ("SHOWCASE-S5-REFLECTION-DIFFS", 3u32, "2026-11-09T20:19Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "DONE 11-09 20:2x. Proof: ganymede run single-flight-20261109-201719 (-Suite all -Filter reflection_diffs -Backend C,Rust -Native): samples/reflection_diffs C ok exit 44, Rust ok exit 44 oracle agree (44 = 'total_cents: 1990 -> 2490' 25 + 'paid: false -> true' 19, the two changed fields found by reflection, unchanged ones skipped). reflection_diffs_type_negative: single error 'Got: {number : i32; customer : string} Expected: {number : i32; customer : string; total_cents : i64; paid : bool}', now an ExpectedErrors row. Rust attempt rust_attempt.rs rustc 1.102.0-nightly: 2x error[E0599] no method named fields found for reference &T. DoD: met. Real-block facts found: record_fold_back gives { state key value }; key is a value symbol, so !!!!SymbolToString(key), not symbol_to_string_real; list literals are not allowed there (Nil string); a typed generic called from real code needs its type applied first: field_change (alue) ...")
