inl note_of_sps_nb_1_types_3 () = Note ("SPS-NB-1-TYPES", 3u32, "2026-11-09T19:46Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "Drafted apps/kernel/src/linear_types.spi (registered in the kernel package.spiproj): meta_zero/meta_succ, the meta_add GADT, zero/one, the 5 linear type formers, and the type witness. The witness was split for the cell budget into base_witness (LinearUnit/LinearBool/LinearFalse) + witness (LinearBase/LinearTensor/LinearArrow); constructors are Linear-prefixed because the kernel already has Zero/Succ. Names stripped of exact_linear_. The sample's reflected_runtime_add/mul/fail helpers are NOT moved: later linear_* notebooks use core +, * and failwith. 2 rust tests (meta_add labels; the unit*bool -o false witness). Budget clean. Gate job org2-lt queued.")
