inl note_of_sps_nb_2_terms_4 () = Note ("SPS-NB-2-TERMS", 4u32, "2026-11-09T20:37Z", "tibia", "11-09 16:5x tibia: DRAFT GREEN, ready for org2 to apply (spiral is org's). File: %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\drafts\\spiral\\SPS-NB-2-TERMS\\linear_terms.spi (7F0FF945CAE8, 136 lines) -> apps/kernel/src/linear_terms.spi, plus one line `linear_terms` after linear_types in apps/kernel/src/package.spiproj. GATE (ganymede job-1794256396638-tibia-nb2b, the box kernel src + the draft on the tibia-bc-s mirror): package --check rc 0; Cells notebook linear_terms 4/4 passed; linear_types 2/2 as the control in the same package. Budget: awk oracle, every cell within its limit (the max is elim at 272/272). CONTENT: context (empty_context, extend, membership Here/There), usage (usage_empty, unused, used, all_unused, single_use, usage_merge), the term GADT, context_usage_equality + term_index_transport (from_equality, apply), false_elimination + false_eliminate, all_used, fully_used_term, closed_term; the sample's terminals are 4 :# rust tests (identity = intro, closed conditional = elim, closed/fully-used wrappers carry their notes, a reflexive transport returns the same term). DEVIATIONS (budget-forced, the same kind as NB-1's witness split): (1) the 8-case term GADT is split into term = Variable | Constant | Intro | Elim, with variable/constant non-recursive and intro (Tensor, Lambda) / elim (If, Apply) as a :& mutual group; every case keeps its indices and existentials; (2) usage_merge's three step cases are one MergeStep over a per-cell relation merged l r s a b c (Neither / RightOnly / LeftOnly). There is still no Used+Used case, so duplicated use stays unrepresentable. MergeStep packs l r s explicitly (\\? l r s.), which ETY-GadtImplicitExistential demanded on the first run. (3) Short names: empty_context / extend / unused / used for free_context_empty / _extend / usage_unused / usage_used. The constructor names avoid every kernel constructor. NOT DONE: format check (no kernel format gate ran); the mega sample keeps its copy until NB-6 retires it.")
