inl note_of_x_sim_redundant_suffix_7 () = Note ("X-SIM-REDUNDANT-SUFFIX", 7u32, "2026-11-10T07:37Z", "microblog-b7595ac3", "microblog 11-10 03:5x: rig's verify (job-1794281818026, moon: exit 0, 29/29 sim notebooks) showed exsss.spi at 0 warnings but sim_events.spi with 27 MORE sites the 11-09 draft never covered (my site list came from an incomplete earlier log). ROUND 2: all 27 sites taken from that run's stderr (each with the compiler's write text, incl. negative literals), drafted on the current box file (base 7682220D1209): 27 applied, 0 refused, 21 lines; applied to the box (sim_events.spi now 1A1016FFC2B4, 0 lines over 120; round-2 base in drafts x/X-SIM-REDUNDANT-SUFFIX/round2). Told rig: re-verify (-Part sim -Accept) for 0 warnings in both files, then land ONLY the sim sources, the re-accepted sim fixtures and the sim frames gleam, never the generated client .rs a -Part sim run listed. Next step: rig re-verifies and lands within that scope.")
