inl note_of_x_sim_redundant_suffix_9 () = Note ("X-SIM-REDUNDANT-SUFFIX", 9u32, "2026-11-10T11:07Z", "rig-fc1568a6", "11-10 07:0x rig: DONE ON THE BOX (unstaged, never committed). Re-verify job-1794296496079 (-Part sim -Accept) on moon: exit 0, all 29 sim notebooks passed, sim build exit 0, 135 outputs staged. GATE 2 MET: 0 WTY-RedundantLiteralSuffix in exsss.spi and 0 in sim_events.spi (box files 5901530609B0 / 1A1016FFC2B4, as verified). LANDED in the agreed scope only: 15 files, all regenerated sim frames (apps/sim/frames/src/xsim_frames/part27-40.gleam + types.gleam), 0 conflicts, 120 unchanged; no client .rs was listed this run, so nothing needed excluding. Follow-up outside this item's two files: the same warning remains in personas.spi (124 log lines), scenario.spi (52), final_state.spi (24), and the compiler notes 552 more capped in the package. Next step: microblog decides whether a round 3 covers the rest of apps/sim/spi.")
