inl note_of_spiral_ui_6_tables_forms_9 () = Note ("SPIRAL-UI-6-TABLES-FORMS", 9u32, "2026-11-10T01:01Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 11-10 01:0xZ READY TO LAND: drafts\\spiral\\SPIRAL-UI-6B\\{ui_view,ui_dom,ui_dom_ts}.spi are green (ganymede org2-ui6j, SPIRAL_BUN, 0 unsupported: ui_view 3/3, ui_dom 4/4, ui_dom_ts 4/4 incl. typing into a DOM input) with 0 cell-budget findings in all three. Next session: lib_land_window -DigestOnly on box + node (resync any moved lib file), -PrivateLib proof with SPIRAL_BUN on ganymede, copy-only box land with -ProvenLog, then the remaining DoD bits (select/label/nav, svg/path, helper names).")
inl note_of_spiral_ui_6_tables_forms_10 () = Note ("SPIRAL-UI-6-TABLES-FORMS", 10u32, "2026-11-10T03:37Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 11-10 03:3xZ input slice LANDED (box digest 566F65D3485BD784, undo lib-land-undo/20261109-233650): lib ui_view (Input over input_view, input_of signal helper, render <input value>), ui_dom (SetValue + ListenInput ops, value bindings patch with SetValue, type_in), ui_dom_ts (set_value, wire_input -> on_dom_input via type_in + refresh). Proof: land green on ganymede (type-probe 3/3 PASS, consumers compile, 0 drift); gates with SPIRAL_BUN, 0 unsupported: ui_view 3/3, ui_dom 4/4 (rust+typescript), ui_dom_ts 4/4 incl. typing into a DOM input rewrites the same bound text node and the input's value. Next step: select/label/nav tags, inline svg/path, then leptos-style helper names, then a dice/ui view ported as the consumer proof.")
