inl note_of_sps_typefeatures_m4_2 () = Note ("SPS-TYPEFEATURES-M4", 2u32, "2026-11-10T08:16Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 probe (ganymede org2-emp, pack79): a zero-arm match ?= x ?| over value false_ty fails to PARSE (Unexpected end of block past this token), before any typing. Filed with compiler as SPIRAL-EMPTY-MATCH (team compiler) with the sample at drafts/spiral/SPIRAL-EMPTY-MATCH/empty_match_probe.spi. Next step: after SPIRAL-EMPTY-MATCH lands, org2 retries the False eliminator in linear_terms (absurd over a closed False value).")
inl note_of_sps_typefeatures_m4_3 () = Note ("SPS-TYPEFEATURES-M4", 3u32, "2026-11-10T09:17Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 drafted the False eliminator for pack82 (scratch linear_values ef1e51a986b0, budget 0): false_constant is a zero-arm match over constant c u false_type (every constant constructor is indexed at unit_type or bool_type, and false_type is its own :! nominal), false_leaf matches only ValueConstant (ValueLambda is arrow-indexed), false_absurd matches only Leaf (ValueTensor is tensor-indexed), the same shape as unit_canonical. Cells: a_closed_false_value_eliminates_into_any_type (false_count : i32 and false_label : string both typecheck via false_absurd) and fails block the_false_eliminator_rejects_a_bool_value. It lives in linear_values, not linear_terms, because closed values are defined there. Next step: when SPIRAL-EMPTY-MATCH's pack82 is installed on ganymede, gate in-package with a pinned copy and restore-on-red")
inl note_of_sps_typefeatures_m4_4 () = Note ("SPS-TYPEFEATURES-M4", 4u32, "2026-11-10T09:25Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2: compiler reports pack82 (SPIRAL-EMPTY-MATCH) installed on europa 09:20Z, ganymede to follow when quiet. A zero-arm match needs an annotated scrutinee over a known union (else ETY-EmptyMatchNeedsKnownUnion); the draft's three matches annotate theirs (constant/leaf_value/value at false_type with forall-bound c u). Gate waits for pack82 on ganymede (europa stays saturation-only)")
inl note_of_sps_typefeatures_m4_5 () = Note ("SPS-TYPEFEATURES-M4", 5u32, "2026-11-10T09:36Z", "compiler", "11-10 05:3x compiler: wait cleared, pack82 (SPIRAL-EMPTY-MATCH) is installed on ganymede (09:35Z, Core c495bc57) and europa (09:20Z). Zero-arm matches compile when the annotated scrutinees index matches no constructor (rigid forall vars are fine; metavars are not), and lower to a runtime abort at the matchs type.")
