inl note_of_fiscal_nfe_stamped_window_1 () = Note ("FISCAL-NFE-STAMPED-WINDOW", 1u32, "2026-11-10T08:42Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "Sibling of FISCAL-CFDI-STAMPED-WINDOW (Done 11-10): the corpus has NF-e schemas but no NF-e INSTANCE (grep for <vUnCom> under deps/corpus: 0 files). DoD: one real NF-e 4.00 XML from a public fixture source (e.g. the sped-nfe project's test fixtures), pinned by sha256 in fiscal scripts/init.ps1; a test that every det/prod's vProd is Within families::NfeItem's window for its qCom x vUnCom; written decimals read from the text. Next step: find a public NF-e 4.00 fixture with several items and decimal quantities, record its URL and hash.")
inl note_of_fiscal_nfe_stamped_window_2 () = Note ("FISCAL-NFE-STAMPED-WINDOW", 2u32, "2026-11-10T08:46Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "fiscal 11-10 05:0x SOURCE PINNED: two AUTHORIZED NF-e from the sped-nfe project's test fixtures (github nfephp-org/sped-nfe, tests/fixtures/xml) at commit ff80086aa16576345a519629efdd9a05fc49226a, pinned in fiscal scripts/init.ps1 (unstaged) under deps/corpus/br/sped-nfe-fixtures and placed locally: 2017protocoled.xml (layout 3.10, cStat 100, nProt 135170001136476, 2017-03-16; one item qCom 389.9500 x vUnCom 49.9200000000 = 19466.304, vProd 19466.30: a real rounding case) sha256 EE06EE4FB9437667...; nfe_layout4_com_prot.xml (layout 4.00, cStat 100; one trivial item 10.0000 x 50 = 500.00) sha256 7BB040F311E64641.... The NT 2011/004 item rule predates 4.00, so the 3.10 sample is valid evidence for the window. Repo license reads NOASSERTION in the GitHub API, so the fixtures stay a download pin (not committed). The other sped-nfe NF-e fixtures have exact products only (x 1.0000). Next step: draft the test (read det/prod via child_named, check vProd with families::window_check NfeItem) in a fiscal module beside currency's stamped CFDI check.")
inl note_of_fiscal_nfe_stamped_window_3 () = Note ("FISCAL-NFE-STAMPED-WINDOW", 3u32, "2026-11-10T08:50Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "fiscal 11-10 05:1x DRAFT drafts\\fiscal\\FISCAL-NFE-STAMPED-WINDOW\\currency.spi A6CDA12D over live ADEF83E0: nfe_root (nfeProc of a pinned fixture), nfe_product (NFe > infNFe > det > prod via the module's child_of), element_amount (element text, not attributes), nfe_item_within (families::window_check families::NfeItem on qCom, vUnCom, vProd); tests: the authorized 2017 NF-e item (389.95 x 49.92 = 19466.304, billed 19466.30) and the 4.00 one (10 x 50 = 500.00) are Within. Cell budget 0 over, lib_roundtrip canonical. Box gate queued (starts after 3 calm minutes under 70%). Next step: record the gate's verdict; on green, land currency.spi and close.")
inl note_of_fiscal_nfe_stamped_window_4 () = Note ("FISCAL-NFE-STAMPED-WINDOW", 4u32, "2026-11-10T12:36Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "fiscal 11-10 08:3x PROVEN AND LANDED. ganymede gate job-1794312384062-fiscal-gany-gate (first fiscal package gate on ganymede: node-proof mirrors of spiral + fiscal matching the box trees incl. unstaged, corpus shipped once as a tarball, pinned compiler copy, memo off, build.ps1 -Files currency,posting,lifecycle,p2p -Parallel 1 -NoGateCache): p2p 39/39, lifecycle 16/16, currency 17/17, posting 6/6, all failed 0; currency.spi A6CDA12D: 17/17 including the two NF-e tests (the authorized 2017 NF-e 3.10 item 389.95 x 49.92 = 19466.304 billed 19466.30 and the 4.00 item are Within families::NfeItem's window). Copied over live ADEF83E0 (unstaged); undo in drafts\\fiscal\\FISCAL-NFE-STAMPED-WINDOW\\undo-20261110-083128. Fixtures pinned in scripts/init.ps1 (sped-nfe commit ff80086a). Next step: none; Done.")
