inl note_of_pascal_empty_union_1 () = Note ("PASCAL-EMPTY-UNION", 1u32, "2026-11-10T08:47Z", "compiler", "From SPIRAL-EMPTY-MATCH: value false_ty specializes to a union with no cases; F# needed struct end (fixed in pack82). Pascal prints record tag: LongInt; end (fine) but its helper case x.tag of <arms> end has no arms, possibly a Free Pascal syntax error. TypeFeatures: none (codegen). Next step: on moon (has fpc), compile apps/compiler/tmp/samples/empty_match_false_eliminator with --backend Pascal on pack82+ and build it; if it fails, print an else branch for zero arms, then add Pascal to the sample's Backends.")
