inl note_of_sps_open_typed_substitution_10 () = Note ("SPS-OPEN-TYPED-SUBSTITUTION", 10u32, "2026-11-10T11:54Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 slice 7a GREEN in a scratch package (ganymede org2-ots7, box kernel + the new module registered after linear_weakened: linear_fused_substitution 2/2, 0 unsupported): new module apps/kernel/src/linear_fused_substitution.spi 96a0b1716cb5 with the fused union fs (FsVar / FsLeft / FsLam over payload unions fsv / fsl / fsm: an osub-style selection whose replacement is a tstr into the target context, three merges per pair: source, intermediate, target), fused_steps, the two-cell fused_var (replacement strengthened by remove_plan) and fused_left (Bool sibling strengthened by StrengthenHere); positive cell 0/1 and a_fused_strengthening_cannot_drop_the_replacement = recursive_open_typed_substitution_strengthening_drops_replacement. Not on the box yet: 7b (fused_lambda under a Unit binder: VUnused over remove_plan, VUsedHere for the binder) is gating as org2-ots7b in the same file; both land together with the package.spiproj registration once green")
inl note_of_sps_open_typed_substitution_11 () = Note ("SPS-OPEN-TYPED-SUBSTITUTION", 11u32, "2026-11-10T11:57Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 slice 7b GREEN (ganymede org2-ots7b, scratch package: linear_fused_substitution 4/4, 0 unsupported) and the module is now on the box and the mirror (unstaged): apps/kernel/src/linear_fused_substitution.spi 1b40c52ee523, registered after linear_weakened in package.spiproj d189bf84c21d (the only module list in the repo). 7b adds fused_lambda under a Unit binder (the selected cell moves to slot 1, the replacement is strengthened by VUnused over remove_plan, the binder survives by VUsedHere over StrengthenHere), positive fused_steps 2, and a_fused_lambda_cannot_drop_the_replacement = recursive_open_typed_substitution_strengthening_lambda_drops_replacement. Every open-typed negative is now accounted for. A consolidation gate of the registered mirror package (org2-kcons) is running before the item closes")
