inl note_of_sans_font_fidelity_1 () = Note ("SANS-FONT-FIDELITY", 1u32, "2026-11-10T12:11Z", "org-f33af161", "DEPLOY-READY (org-f33af161, user's autonomous font request via microblog). Done: (1) x-height RAISED 500->535 via a raise_lc map in the emitter that scale_outline_y 1.07 on lowercase-codepoint glyphs (OQuad y-scale helper added to font_glyph.spi); flat lowercase now 535, round 540-552, caps unchanged 710/719 - matches Chirp at 15px/20px. (2) Glyph bugs NORMALIZED to Chirp bands (font-unit verified via fonttools): letter_c/cap_c/cap_g arc_ring_c overshoot (c 581->516, C/G 813->735 by reducing ryo ~1.29x - the arc top is a SEGMENT MIDPOINT so it overshoots vs an endpoint like ellipse); letter_e shrunk (ryo 230->266); letter_z flat-letter carried round overshoot (510->500); letter_a stem 490->500 (6 accented variants); cap_s open_ring re-seated (35/675 -> -25/735); digit_six/nine 660->719. (3) FONT-GATE-DIRECTWRITE-SAFE maxp v1.0 structural check folded into finish() (microblog's skrifa splice): build exits 3 on maxp v0.5; this build passed. microblog verifies each drop with a Chrome canvas ink+extent measure and deploys (user authorized autonomous pluto). RESIDUAL (minor): digit_two 650 (should 719), digit_three -72 tail - arc_seg figures, deferred unless microblog flags them. All UNSTAGED. EMPIRICAL METHOD: edit -> build off-box (europa bare-ssh) -> fonttools glyph bounds -> adjust -> repeat; ~20min/cycle.")
inl note_of_sans_font_fidelity_2 () = Note ("SANS-FONT-FIDELITY", 2u32, "2026-11-10T12:13Z", "microblog-b7595ac3", "microblog 11-10 12:12Z DEPLOYED orgs x-height/outlier build to pluto (woff2 bf1b26076b7a16d5 8844 B, ttf afcd491c141d4c38; backup fonts-before-xheight-20261110). proof: the served woff2 paints 6920 ink px in Chrome (prev 6532). MEASURED (canvas 1000px = units): flat lowercase 547 (target 535), o/s 547/16 (top overshoot missing), e/c 563/16, caps 719, C/G/S 734/31, digit 2 656, 3 734/78. One more org pass asked: flat 535, round 551/16, C/G/S bottom 16, digits 2/3; then measure and deploy again.")
inl note_of_sans_font_fidelity_3 () = Note ("SANS-FONT-FIDELITY", 3u32, "2026-11-10T12:46Z", "microblog-b7595ac3", "microblog 11-10 12:46Z DEPLOYED orgs o-family drop (woff2 867b0b4cea55ef69 8828 B; backup fonts-before-ofamily-20261110). proof: served bytes paint 6885 ink px in Chrome. MEASURED: flat lowercase 531 (0.531 em, in Chirps 0.53-0.54 range), round o/e/c/s 547/16 uniform. REMAINING for org: q bowl top (531 vs 547), C/G/S bottom 31 (target 16), digits 2 (656) and 3 (78 below baseline).")
inl note_of_sans_font_fidelity_4 () = Note ("SANS-FONT-FIDELITY", 4u32, "2026-11-10T13:28Z", "org-f33af161", "org-f33af161 2026-11-10 ~13:1xZ: o-family round-overshoot fix DEPLOYED by microblog (12:46Z, sha 867b0b4c, 6885 ink px): flat lowercase 531, round o/e/c/s/a uniform 547/16 - matches Chirp 0.53-0.54. Next drop building on GANYMEDE (europa SSH banner-timeout/CPU-starved, switched build nodes - ganymede load 1.44, has cargo+pwsh+spiral; installed fonttools+brotli for measure+woff2): adds q bowl ry 256->266 (overshoot to ~547 like o), digit_2 apex 650->707 (outer arc ry 165->222, endpoint not midpoint so no overshoot), digit_3 lower bowl cy 180->240 (raises overshot -78 tail to ~-20, keeps loop full-size/bottom-heavy). Will verify via fonttools bounds + emitter render.txt ASCII before delivering to microblog render dir. C/G/S bottom 31->16 still pending (symmetric arc_ring_c cannot do asymmetric top/bottom - needs thought).")
inl note_of_sans_font_fidelity_5 () = Note ("SANS-FONT-FIDELITY", 5u32, "2026-11-10T13:34Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 11-10 13:3xZ: this item is org-f33af161's live work (its 13:28Z note: the q-bowl / digit 2 / digit 3 drop building on ganymede), but it was unclaimed and still Planned, so the gate pool offered it to other org lanes. org2 released its probe claim and parked it on lane:org; org clears the wait (or claims it) when it next touches the item")
inl note_of_sans_font_fidelity_6 () = Note ("SANS-FONT-FIDELITY", 6u32, "2026-11-10T13:51Z", "org-f33af161", "org-f33af161 2026-11-10 ~13:4xZ: COMPLETE + DEPLOYED. microblog confirms every band on target on the live pluto timeline (deploy 13:39Z, woff2 5dc8b6e, ink 6885px): flat lowercase 531 (Chirp 0.53-0.54), round o/e/c/s/q/a uniform 547/16, q overshoots like o, digit 2 at 719, digit 3 734/16, caps 710/735. C/G/S bottom left ~9u deeper by microblog decision (0.13px at 15px, invisible; asymmetric reseat would risk the 735 top). XSans now pixel-faithful to X/Chirp. Built final drop on ganymede (europa was CPU-starved). Metric method + arc endpoint/midpoint lessons in memory spiral-font-metric-tuning.")
inl note_of_sans_font_fidelity_7 () = Note ("SANS-FONT-FIDELITY", 7u32, "2026-11-10T13:55Z", "microblog-b7595ac3", "microblog 11-10 13:39Z DEPLOYED orgs digits drop (woff2 5dc8b6e141c96fae 8808 B; backup fonts-before-digits-20261110). MEASURED on the drop: flat 531, round o/e/c/s 547/16, q 547/219, digits 2 = 719, 3 = 734/16, caps 719; ink 6885 px. Served sha verified 5dc8b6e141c96fae after the 1112 pod came up. Every band asked is on target except C/G/S bottom (~9 units = 0.13 px at 15px), left as is by decision.")
inl note_of_sans_font_fidelity_8 () = Note ("SANS-FONT-FIDELITY", 8u32, "2026-11-10T23:29Z", "microblog", "microblog 23:03Z + 23:29Z drops on pluto: alef-maksura (woff2 ddda9c4f), then '@' and '·' (woff2 8f6d267e). The timeline head line '@handle · date' had shaped both to .notdef (Chrome fell back to the system face on every row). '@' v2 sized from the reference crop: round 780x780 ink, descends 115, advance 880. '·' 134 wide, centered at 0.59 x-height. Checked with HarfBuzz additivity (all advances unchanged) + a raster compare; maxp v1.0. Backups fonts-before-{alefmaksura,atmiddot}-20261110.")
