inl fiscal_ledger_nfe_por_dentro () = Task ("FISCAL-LEDGER-NFE-POR-DENTRO", "fiscal ledger: post an NF-e whose ICMS is included in the price (por dentro), so the generic journal law covers Brazil", TaskKind, P2, D3, 100u32, Done, "", "fiscal,erp,br,nfe,team:fiscal", "current", "current")
inl planning_of_fiscal_ledger_nfe_por_dentro () = Planning ("FISCAL-LEDGER-NFE-POR-DENTRO", Minutes 120u32, Load Light, Assigned Agent)
inl note_of_fiscal_ledger_nfe_por_dentro_1 () = Note ("FISCAL-LEDGER-NFE-POR-DENTRO", 1u32, "2026-11-10T12:38Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "Split from FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER (Done 11-10): the generic law (receivable BT-112 = revenue BT-109 + tax BT-110) holds for EN 16931 and CFDI, where tax is added on top. NF-e ICMS is embedded in vProd ('por dentro'), so vNF is not net + ICMS: revenue must be credited net of the embedded ICMS and ICMS-ST/IPI are added differently. Real documents are pinned: deps/corpus/br/sped-nfe-fixtures (2017protocoled.xml 3.10, nfe_layout4_com_prot.xml 4.00). DoD: an NF-e posting rule from ICMSTot (vProd, vDesc, vICMS, vST, vIPI, vNF) whose journal balances and turns over vNF, tested on both fixtures, with the por-dentro ICMS credited to ICMS a recolher. Next step: read both fixtures' ICMSTot and write the posting identity (vNF = vProd - vDesc + vST + vFrete + vSeg + vOutro + vIPI + vII) as a test before the journal.")
inl note_of_fiscal_ledger_nfe_por_dentro_2 () = Note ("FISCAL-LEDGER-NFE-POR-DENTRO", 2u32, "2026-11-10T13:28Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "fiscal 11-10 10:2x DRAFT drafts\\fiscal\\FISCAL-LEDGER-NFE-POR-DENTRO\\posting.spi 2C5CF36A over live F0909F5A: nfe_icms_tot reads nfeProc > NFe > infNFe > total > ICMSTot of the pinned fixtures; nfe_identity_holds checks vNF = vProd - vDesc - vICMSDeson + vST + vFCPST + vFrete + vSeg + vOutro + vII + vIPI + vIPIDevol (19466.30 and 500.00 from the fixtures); the journal debits receivable vNF and credits receita bruta (vNF - vST - vIPI), credits ICMS-ST and IPI payables, and posts ICMS, PIS and COFINS inside the price as balanced pairs (debit '<tax> sobre vendas', credit '<tax> a recolher'); nfe_law_holds = typed BRL journal balances and its debits equal vNF + vICMS + vPIS + vCOFINS. Tests: both_authorized_nfe_satisfy_the_total_identity, a_por_dentro_nfe_books_a_balanced_brl_journal. Every cell under 272 by the oracle. Next step: after the queued cell-budget/round-trip check, gate posting on ganymede (fiscal-gate-on-ganymede recipe) and land on green.")
inl note_of_fiscal_ledger_nfe_por_dentro_3 () = Note ("FISCAL-LEDGER-NFE-POR-DENTRO", 3u32, "2026-11-10T14:11Z", "fiscal-84b53718", "fiscal 11-10 11:1x PROVEN AND LANDED. ganymede gate job-1794319412664-fiscal-gany-nfe-ledger (fiscal-gate-on-ganymede recipe; pinned compiler; memo off): posting.spi 2C5CF36A GREEN, discovered 8 executed 8 passed 8 failed 0 (the 6 FISCAL-ERP-LEDGER tests plus both_authorized_nfe_satisfy_the_total_identity and a_por_dentro_nfe_books_a_balanced_brl_journal over the two pinned authorized NF-e). Copied over live F0909F5A (unstaged); undo in C:\\Users\\i574n\\AppData\\Local\\kit\\drafts\\fiscal\\FISCAL-LEDGER-NFE-POR-DENTRO\\undo-20261110-101137. The generic ledger law now covers Brazil too: the NF-e total identity holds, and ICMS, PIS and COFINS embedded in the price post as balanced deduction/payable pairs while the receivable is vNF. Next step: none; Done.")
