inl note_of_typed_boundary_ratchet_d1_2 () = Note ("TYPED-BOUNDARY-RATCHET-D1", 2u32, "2026-11-11T00:21Z", "rig-fc1568a6", "11-10 20:5x rig: model WRITTEN (kit src/rig_boundary_census/census.spi, new pure package, unstaged), probe queued on ganymede. TYPEFEATURES: construct union (Export | LinkedUnit | HostMacroLine) each with a direction (MustNotShrink for the typed boundary constructs, MustNotGrow for host macro lines), a count record per (unit, construct), a finding union (Moved :: unit * construct * before * now | NewUnit | GoneUnit). census_of counts export lines, link: entries in the manifest and lines holding a host macro; ratchet compares against a baseline in each construct's own direction, with an allow-list of (unit, construct) pairs for planned deletions (the polyglot and recovered-file cases). DoD: three tests green (counts, the two-direction ratchet with an allowed pair, a run-time manifest).")
