inl note_of_quiet_window_forecast_d1_2 () = Note ("QUIET-WINDOW-FORECAST-D1", 2u32, "2026-11-11T00:24Z", "rig-fc1568a6", "11-10 21:0x rig: model WRITTEN (kit src/rig_quiet_forecast/forecast.spi, new pure package, unstaged), probe queued on ganymede. TYPEFEATURES: a quiet union (QuietNow | QuietAfter :: time * last blocker), records busy, queued and machine_state; the edit-time census floor refused a first draft that returned a bare u64, and the union is also the better answer (it names what blocks the machine). running_end + queue_spans lay the queue end to end after the running jobs (one heavy slot); earliest_gap sorts every busy span (strict predicate) and sweeps to the first gap of the wanted length, so a gap too short is skipped. DoD: three tests green (gaps, a machine with running/queue/window, run-time holders).")
