inl compiler_warn_unused_definition () = Task ("COMPILER-WARN-UNUSED-DEFINITION", "WTY-UnusedDefinition for app packages: a top-level definition that no module of the package or its consumers reaches (not main, not a test entry, not exported, not in lib) is reported; lib-wide reach stays with LIB-USAGE-DIAGNOSTICS; dead helpers are found by review today (X-REQUESTS-REVIEW)", Story, P2, D3, 0u32, Planned, "", "team:compiler,compiler,warnings,diagnostics,dead-code", "current", "current")
