inl rig_warnings_fix () = Task ("RIG-WARNINGS-FIX", "rig lint warnings <root> [--fix]: runs the compiler with SPIRAL_WARNINGS_OUT over a repo, groups rows by code with a baseline, and with --fix applies the machine-applicable spans (drop an unused open, drop a stray ^, drop a redundant literal suffix) as one reviewable edit, replacing the grep-and-hand-edit cleanups lanes do now", Story, P1, D3, 0u32, Planned, "COMPILER-WARN-SURFACE", "team:rig,rig,lint,warnings,tooling", "current", "current")
