inl note_of_ui_sota_reactive_1 () = Note ("UI-SOTA-REACTIVE", 1u32, "2026-11-11T04:23Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "DoD: ui signals drop memo deps : list i32 and reaction deps (dependencies hand-written as ints today); reads inside a memo or effect register themselves; one set notifies each dependent exactly once in topological order (test: diamond graph, no glitch value observed); batch groups sets; disposing an owner stops its effects; a resource exposes loading/ready/error as a GADT state. Tests on rust and typescript. Next step: design the tracking without runtime existentials (compile-time packs only): the record-as-store lens design of SPIRAL-UI-2-SIGNALS n3 stays, and the dependency set becomes a typed set of signal handles. TypeFeatures: signal and memo as phantom-indexed handles over the model, resource state as a GADT, owner as an existential scope.")
