inl note_of_rig_new_harvest_4 () = Note ("RIG-NEW-HARVEST", 4u32, "2026-11-11T05:08Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 11-11 01:4x row-check status: corrections from fiscal (census row: the real feature is Forall polymorphic recursion, and lib xsd.spi canonical is the true Gadt proof), microblog (sim_events round trip = streams_decode_back_to_themselves) and org3 all went to rig. org3's hard finding: the realworld reply-indexed routes row overclaims, because its token clause is proven by the auth.spi request authenticated witness GADT, not by realworld_api.spi; split it into a route-spec row and a verified-token-witness row. RULE for every kept row, from org3: a type-level cannot invariant must cite a NEGATIVE test (fails Unification), as dice's phase-indexed plan does. html model.spi and alphabet font_outline cite only positive tests today. tibia's held-out seed split row is still waiting on tibia.")
