inl note_of_showcase_expect_inline_2 () = Note ("SHOWCASE-EXPECT-INLINE", 2u32, "2026-11-11T05:01Z", "org-5a6e53fb", "org2 11-11 01:2x hand-off order: compiler writes the test-block shape on showcase_gadt_rules and pings fiscal when it is green; fiscal then applies it to hkt_one_rule and fiscal_kernel and archives the .expect files. Fiscal checked 11-11 night: all three .expect files still present, no test blocks yet.")
inl rig_crash_dump_watch () = Task ("RIG-CRASH-DUMP-WATCH", "Crash dumps are diagnosed and healed within the hour, never left for days: every Erlang run writes its dump to a known per-job path, rig machine watch reads each new dump's slogan, classifies it and files or updates a backlog item, on the box and every node", Story, P0, D4, 0u32, Planned, "", "crash,beam,watch,team:rig", "current", "current")
